<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">1Ɔkɔrɛtiya</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Ɔkɔrɛtiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">1Ɔkɔrɛtiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Okor</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kwupu Ungwu Kwonze Ungwu Ɔpɔlu A Ka Laa Enzu Umba OKORETI</para>
  <para style="is">Kambu Iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwupu ungwu Ɔpɔlu ungwu Kwonze laa enzu umba Ɔkɔrɛti o kangwu kaa lo yese apula iyira iyi i yi mu iwomo mu ɔshɔshi uwu bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu a bɔ mu Ɔkɔrɛti. Kwuye kwɔngwu Ɔkɔrɛti akwu kwuse ungwɔkwu ungwu Agiriki. Ungwu gba akwu kwuse ungwɛka mu ɛzhi iyi Oromu mu Akaya le. O yitu ngwu gyɔɔ kwuwongu rishi iwomo ngwu, mbala aruwashi iyi iyitu mbala ilukwu igagyima, mbala kaya itomo, mbala ɛgwuzɛ ikikɔ ikikɔ iyi Ukpo imbwaluma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kiya ingyi ki to egbo iyi Ɔpɔlu ma bɔkɔ ki shi wu ubugyi gba akwu ikama yɛyɛyɛ mbala kaya itomo mu ɔshɔshi, eyo meka iyi inɔma iyi oko mbala ɔnzɔnu, oko itomo mbala ɔnu iyama, mbala rɛshi ingyi bɔkɔ Kundu uwu Ukpo e shi, mbala iyimo mu kwuvɔ. E so mbo ewo iyi bɔkɔ Iso Iyesheshi iyi Ukpo ɛlɛ i gba opwu laa eyo ɛlɛ lɛɛbi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Umɛ uwakwu uwu uwo la ɛla uwu kwupu kwɔlɛ, kwu zɔ tee idɛnyi gba akwu rɛshi ingyi Ukpo ingyi ri ka le lɛɛbi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi Mɛmi</para>
  <para style="ip">Kambu iyemo (1.1-9)</para>
  <para style="ip">Ikama mu ɔshɔshi (1.10-4.21)</para>
  <para style="ip">Kaya itomo mbala iŋɔma iyi kwogba (5.1-7.40)</para>
  <para style="ip">Wambwalu mbala wabyeshi ( 8.1-11.1)</para>
  <para style="ip">Ukpo ilɛma mbala ɔya igbomo mu ɔshɔshi (11.2-14.40)</para>
  <para style="ip">Iyimo mu kwuvɔ iyi Okrasi mbala iyi wambwalu (15.1-58)</para>
  <para style="ip">Rɛshi iwomo laa Wambwalu mu Ozhudiya (16.1-4)</para>
  <para style="ip">Imbwama iyi iso ( 16.5-24)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Imi Ɔpɔlu, mu inyama iyi Ukpo mi kwu u zɛ ilɔ uwu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi, mbala umanyinzu Osositini.<verse eid="1CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Gba mi ka yi kwupu kwɔlɛ le, lunyi wa mbwalu Ukpo mu ɔshɔshi uwu Ɔkɔrɛti, lunyi umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a ŋa yi lɛnwu akwɛyi a ngbɛlɛ yi e lo mesu mbala Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi, kaa la lu kwu enzu wu, ikyo mbala enzu lɛɛbi munamuna umba bɔkɔ o na Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi te lakwu Ɔkwu mba kyamate bɔkɔ kinzu ki na wu akwu Ɔkwu nzu tayi.<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Ukpo Ete nzu mbala Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi le shi yi esheshi wu mbala egbo mɛzhi.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Esheshi Mu Okrasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Mi gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi kwuwo yi iyɔkpɔɔ kwuwongu esheshi wu iyi bɔkɔ e shi yi iyi bɔkɔ i zɛ mu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Kwuwongwu bɔkɔ lu kwu wa mbwalu Okrasi, o shi yi ingyinangyina ikyo mbala iso isomo mbala iyitu. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Ɛlɛ i zɔ gedegede mekeka yi te iso iyi Okrasi iyi bɔkɔ ki so yi awu, akwu iso iyira mo. <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ, tabɔkɔ lu rigbo igbama iyi Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi awu, rɛshi ingyi bɔkɔ Kwundu Uwu Ukpo gba ee shi le awu, e shi yi ngyi ee. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Ee shi yi ekpasu iyi irima nzhii ba ibomo iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ akwɛyi ɔnu uwu Ɔkwu nzu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi a ba gbama awu, o du yi la ingbomo mo. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ a ya yi ma akwɛyi a ngbɛlɛ yi e lomesu mbala Umɛ wu, Ɔkwu nzu, Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi awu, ee wo iyi bɔkɔ e so lɛɛbi.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikama Yɛyɛyɛ Mu Ɔshɔshi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Mi kpa yi ɛshɛku ɛmɛnɛ mi mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu nzu , Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi te la lu nyama lesu kaa ikama yɛyɛ li fye mekeka yi mo. La lu kpa kyaa kaa egbo yi lakwu ikpɛnyi. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, enzu umbafo umba bɔkɔ ɔ wɔ mogba uwu Okulo, o ka mi la iso te lunyi lu yi mu itumo mbala esu. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Iso iyi mi yi mu isomo gba iyi te: onzu uwufo aa zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Imi mi kwu uwu Ɔpɔlu&gt;&gt;; uwufo aa zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Imi mi kwu uwu Apɔlɔsi&gt;&gt;; uwufo aa zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Imi mi kwu uwu Okefasi&gt;&gt;, uwufo kpɔ, aa zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Imi mi kwu uwu Okrasi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Inyete Ɔzhizɔsi o ka wu ma yɛyɛ re? Akwu Ɔpɔlu gba e kpomo mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu kwuwo yi le re? Naa o wo yi obatisima mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔpɔlu ŋa?<verse eid="1CO 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Mi ngbede la Ukpo tee Okirisipu mbala Ɔgayɔ kɛɛkyi gba mi wo mbo obatisima le, moo mi wo onzu uwunawuna meka yi obatisima mo. <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ onzu uwu bɔkɔ aa zɔ tee Imi mi wo wu obatisima mu ɛnyi mi, e yi mo. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />(Mi lolo o, mi kyo mi wo Ositifana mbala agba wu obatisima tete; mi do te mi lolo te mi wo onzu uwufo obatisima fo.) <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Okrasi a lɔ mi tee la mi wo obatisima mo. A lɔ mi tee la mi tanu iyi rɛnu wu ingyesheshi ngyɛlɛ byi. Anu itama mi ɛlɛ ba lakwu mu ilukwu iyi onzu mo, kaa ekpasu iyi lukwu undu Okrasi e kpo mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu lakwu shaa mo.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okrasi Akwu Ekpasu Mbala Ilukwu Iyi Ukpo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Iso iyi lukwu undu bɔkɔ Okrasi e kpo mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu i yi kyamate iso iyi erendo tayi mbaa enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu itomo; kinzu umba bɔkɔ o yenzu mu isama awu ba, ki yitu te akwu ekpasu iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Ɛlɛ i zɛ kyaa mbala iso iyi bɔkɔ o so mu kwokpo ungwu iso iyi Ukpo tee:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 1:19">&lt;&lt;Imi mi tutu ilukwu iyi enzu umba amasa ma</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 1:19">akwɛyi iyitu iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o to ɛmba tee umba o yitu, mi shi yi mɛmba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Inyete enzu umba ilukwu mbala umba bɔkɔ ɔ wa ɛzu gyɔɔ, mbala umba ɔ zɔ iyitu o yi muna fo? Ukpo a da zɔ yi tee ilukwu iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ akwu erendo mo? <verse eid="1CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Moo mu ilukwu wu, Ukpo ba a nyama tee enzu umba ilukwu lo ra la ilukwu mbo kaa lo yi wu mo. Enzu umba bɔkɔ o na iso wu, iyi bɔkɔ ki ta yi yi anu awu, iyi bɔkɔ enzu umbafo o to yi te akwu iso iyi erendo awu gba Ukpo a sa mba ma le. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Azhu ɔ gyi te lɔ ma lɔzɔ undu amɛ, Agiriki ba o gagyi ilukwu. <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />Kinzu ba ki tanu iyi Okrasi uwu bɔkɔ ɔ kpa wu mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu ɔ ngbɛ wu ma awu, iso ɛlɛ gba i tutu Azhu egbo mo le, enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo ba o to yi te akwu iso iyi erendo; <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />tetete, enzu umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a ya mba ma, la Azhu, la enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo, Okrasi gba akwu ekpasu iyi Ukpo iyi bɔkɔ i sa enzu ma le, uwu tete gba akwu ilukwu iyi Ukpo le. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Moo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ enzu o to ngyi tee akwu erendo iyi Ukpo awu, i ka ilukwu laa ilukwu iyi onzu uwunawuna ma, tatayi iyi bɔkɔ enzu o to yi tee akwu inyɛma iyi ekpasu iyi Ukpo awu ba i ka ekpasu laa ekpasu iyi onzu uwunawuna ma tete.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, la lu lolo ewo iyi bɔkɔ lu yi kwuyengwu Ukpo a ya yi ma awu. Lunyi bwɛɛ bi gba enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o to yi tee lu yi amasa le, lunyi bwɛɛ bi gba lu kwu enzu umbakwu le, ɛmɛ yi bwɛɛ bi gba akwu ɛmɛ umba enzu umbakwu le. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Ukpo ba a ŋa kiya ingyi bɔkɔ kwudu kwɔlɛ kwu to ngyi tee akwu erendo awu kaa le lo enzu umba bɔkɔ kwudu kwɔlɛ kwu to mbo tee akwu enzu umba amasa awu lovya, akwɛyi a ŋa wa kpɔfɔ mu eyi iyi enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ, kaa le lo enzu umba o yi ekpasu lovya. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Ukpo e to apula iyi ɔ zhi yi ma mu kwudu kwɔlɛ, iyi bɔkɔ o to yi tee akwu kiya kinyinyi mo awu, kaa apula iyi bɔkɔ ɔ du yi ma mu kwudu kwɔlɛ awu, la ngbɛ yi ɛdɔma. <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />E wo ɛlɛ kaa onzu uwunawuna le kwɛnwu mu idu iyi Ukpo mo. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Kiya ingyi Ukpo e wo le gba ki shi lu kwu enzu umba Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi le, Okrasi gba akwu ɔgwuzɛ uwu amasa uwu bɔkɔ Ukpo a wa wu kaa la sa enzu ma le. Uwu gba akwu ototo nzu mbaa Ukpo le; uwu gba akwu usama nzu le tete. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, iso iyi Ukpo i zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e kwɛnwu ba le kwu mu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ Ɔkwu e wo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="ms">Ɛlɔgbulɔ Mɛka Iyi Okrasi Uwu O Kpawu Mu Kwuwɛyi Ungwu Lukwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, kwuyengwu bɔkɔ mi ka munyi yi mi ki ta yi anu iyi kwunvyeru ungwu Ukpo awu, mi zɔ ɛmi te mi so iso mi ka yi ma mo, naa mi zɔ yi te mi ka yi ilukwu ma mo. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Moo mi ka mu egbo mi-e tee, iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi mbala lukwu wu mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu kɛɛkyi gba mi tanu yi le, mo mi kyo iso ewa mo. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />kwuyengwu mi bo mbaa yi awu, ɛnwu mi i muma gyɔɔ laa ipulamakwuwongu iyi, <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />ɛzu izɔma mi mbala anu itama mi iyi ɛlɔgbulɔ iyi Ukpo munyi yi, akwu mu ilukwu iyi iso isomo mi mo, akwu mu ekpasu iyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo, <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />kaa ikwu idu lu fulo yi li wɛlɛ mu ilukwu iyi onzu mo, li wɛlɛ mu ekpasu iyi Ukpo.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilukwu Iyi Ukpo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Tetete ɛlɔgbulɔ iyi ilukwu gba ki zɛ le laa umba bɔkɔ ɔ bulɔma-a mu kwundu. Ilukwu ɛlɛ ba akwiyi kwudu kwɔlɛ mo ba akwiyi asu umba ɔyi ɔlɛ mo - umba bɔkɔ ekpasu mba i nda la ibomo fo mo. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Ɛlɔgbulɔ iyi mi zɛ yi ba akwu meka iyi ilukwu iyi Ukpo iyi bɔkɔ e nvye yi mo nzhii ba a ba wa yi kwudu mu kwuye nzu kaa lakwu ɔnyɛ nzu mbala inzumbɛku nzu. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Asu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ ba ukpukpɛnyi mba te a zɔngɔma ilukwu ɛlɛ ma mo; moo lo zɔngɔma yi ma, o ngbɛ Ɔkwu uwu inzumbɛku ma mo.<verse eid="1CO 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Tetete, kyamate bɔkɔ o ka mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo tee,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 2:9">&lt;&lt;Kiya ingyi bɔkɔ onzu uwunawuna a da ma ngyi dɛ mo, a da pwa ngyi dɛ mo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 2:9">ba a da bi egbo ngyi dɛ mo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 2:9">gba Ukpo a nɔngɔ e shi laa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">umba bɔkɔ o pwu idɛnyi wu le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Ukpo ba a zɔ yi nzu mu Kwundu wu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 2:10">Kwundu e yitu iyi kiya ingyinangyina, la apula iyi Ukpo iyi bɔkɔ i kɔma mu idama la onzu. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Moo uwe bɔkɔ e do te e yitu iyi egbo iyi onzu uwufo? Onzu mafyi wu gba e yitu iyi egbo wu le. Tatayi Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yitu iyi egbo iyi Ukpo, akwu Kwundu uwu Ukpo kɛɛkyi. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Kwundu uwu bɔkɔ ki na le, akwu mbaa enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ mo, e ngyi mbaa Ukpo. Kwundu uwu Ukpo ele gba e shi nzu iyitu kaa la ki zɔngɔma apula iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi nzu rɛshi le.<verse eid="1CO 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Ɛlɔgbulɔ ɛlɛ gba ki ye yi mu izɛma le, ba akwu mu ilukwu iyi ɔ zɔ nzu izɔma mu kwudu kwɔlɛ mo, akwu mu ilukwu iyi bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Ukpo e shi nzu kaa la ki zɛ enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi Kwundu uwu Ukpo ɛlɔgbulɔ iyi Kwundu a lɔ nzu te la ki zɛ. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi Kwundu uwu Ukpo mo, e do tee a na rɛshi ingyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo mo. Iso iyi Ukpo i yi kyamate iso iyi erendo tayi mu eyi wu, uwu ba e do yi izɔngɔma mo, moo Kwundu uwu Ukpo kɛɛkyi gba e shi onzu a zɔngɔma iso iyi Ukpo ma le. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Ukpo e yi mawu, e mondo kiya ingyinangyina ma, onzu uwunawuna ba, e do tee e mondo wu mo mo. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Kyamate Kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu so tee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:16">&lt;&lt;Uwe bɔkɔ e yitu iyi egbo iyi Ɔkwu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:16">Uwe bɔkɔ e do tee a ta wu amasa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Kinzu ba ki yi egbo iyi Okrasi.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="ms">Ɛmɛgba Umba Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, kwuyengwu mi yi mbala yi awu, mi so yi iso kyamate mi so mbala enzu umba o yi Kwundu mo tayi; mi so yi iso kyamate mi so mbala enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ tayi, kyamate ɛmɛ umbelu Okrasi imbwaluma tayi. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Mi shi yi kwɔmɛ moo mi shi yi kiya ingyi irimo ingyɛkɔ mo moo lu du kɔma mo. Kekelele lala lu du kɔma mo kpɔ, <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />moo lu degbo luu wo kyamate enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ tayi. Lu degbo luu wo rise ingyi esu, luu tumo mbala esu kpɔ, ɛlɛ i zɔ gedegede te lu wo apula kyamate enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o wo?<verse eid="1CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Moo umbafo yi ɔ zɔ tee,&lt;&lt;Imi mi mbwalu Ɔpɔlu,&gt;&gt; umbafo ba ɔ zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Imi mi mbwalu Apɔlɔsi&gt;&gt; - ɛlɛ i yi kyamate enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o wo awu mo?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Ishi Ɔpɔlu akwu uwe dɛɛ? Apɔlɔsi tete akwu uwe dɛɛ? Kinzu ki kwu ɛmɛgba umba Ukpo bi umba bɔkɔ lu zɛ mamba gba lu kwu idu lu fulo le. Uwewe nzu e wo ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ Ɔkwu e shi wu te le wo: <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Imi mi somo, Apɔlɔsi ba e kpo embyi akwɛyi Ukpo gba e shi apula i bulɔma le. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Kwuwo kwɔngu, onzu u somo mbala u kpo embyi akwu kiya kinyinyi mo. Ukpo a ka mba ma wepepo mbo moo uwu gba e shi apula i bulɔma le. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Onzu u somo mbala u kpo embyi, eyi ifulomo mbo akwu ikpɛnyi; Ukpo ee shi onzonzu rigbɛ ingyi ri fa la ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ e wo. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Ki wo ɛduma la Ukpo ukpɛnyi; lunyi ba lu yi kyamate utu uwu Ukpo a lɔ nzu te la ki wo ɛduma mawu tayi. Lunyi lu kyo lu yi kyamate ugu uwu Ukpo tayi.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Kwuwongwu esheshi iyi Ukpo e shi mi, Imi gba mi da yi la anu itama iyi Ɔzhizɔsi le kyamate onzu u mbo ugu ɔnyɛ bɔkɔ a ka kwosa ungwesheshi akwɛyi enzu umbafo ba o mbo mangwu tayi. Onzu u mbomo uwunawuna ba la ngbɛndu mu imbomo. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Onzu uwunawuna la ka kwosa ungufo fo, moo kwosa kwu yi mɛzhi-e, ungwu gba akwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi le. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Onzu uwu e wo a ra laa egolu naa esiliva naa ekyi iyi abwa naa ɛwɛyi naa asɛ gba e mbo mu kwosa kwɔlɛ le, <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />ɔnuwu bɔkɔ Okrasi a ba gbama awu ɛduma iyi uwewe o zɔ yi ma pepee moo o pwayi ma mu ɔyi kaa lɔ ma woshi umbwu ɛduma ɛnyi. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ ɛduma wu, ɔyi u pwu yi mo mo, de ba a fya rigbɛ. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ ɛduma wu i pwu mo mɔyi, de ba a fya kiya kinyinyi mo; tetete a fya isama ma, isama wu ba i yi kyamate onzu uwu a wɔ mu kwogba ungwu kwu yi mu ipwumo tayi.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Lunyi lu yitu te lu kwu Ɔtɛpu uwu Ukpo mbaa bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Ukpo e yi le mo? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Gba onzu e tutu Ɔtɛpu uwu Ukpo mo, onzu awu a ma kwuwo ungwu Ukpo, moo Ɔtɛpu uwu Ukpo e yi kɛrikɛri, lunyi gba ba lu kwu Ɔtɛpu wu le.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />La lu kyoro ɛyi yi ma mo. Onzu uwu bɔkɔ enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o to wu te e yi ilukwu, la gba la ɛwu kyamate orondo tayi akwɛyi akwu onzu uwu ilukwu shɛ. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Moo ilukwu iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ akwu erendo meyi iyi Ukpo. Ɛlɛ i zɛ kya mbala iso iyi Ukpo e so mu kwokpo wu tee: &lt;&lt;Enzu umba bɔkɔ o to ɛmba te o yi amasa, kyo la amasa mba, Ukpo e yi yi mbo mo;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />iso ɛlɛ ɔ ka yi kpɔ mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu e yitu tee egbo ibyima iyi onzu uwu ilukwu akwiyi umbwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, la lu lafya laa ɛnwu ikwumo mu onzu, moo kiya ingyinangyina akwu ingya yi lunyi: <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Ɔpɔlu, la Apɔlɔsi, la Okefasi, la kwudu, la kwunyɔ la lukwu, la apula iyi kwushi kwɔlɛ la iyi keyi - lɛɛbi akwu iyayi, <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />lunyi lu kwu umba Okrasi, Okrasi ba akwu uwu Ukpo.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Wa zɛ ilɔ Umba Okrasi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, i fate la lu to nzu te ki kwu ɛmɛgba umba Okrasi umba bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi mbo anu itama iyi iso wu iyi bɔkɔ e nvye yi mo la enzu mo mekyi. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ o shi wu te la bɔ eyi mu ɛduma ɛlɛ, la bɔ shɛɛ mu ɛduma ɛnyi iwomo. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Gba lunyi, na onzu uwunawuna a zɔ te mi wo ɛduma ɔnyɛ, naa mi wo ɔnyɛ mo, ɛlɛ akwu kiya kinyinyi mu eyi mi mo; Imi mafyi mi lala mii zɔ ɛmi ombu te mi wo ɛduma ɔnyɛ naa mi wo ɔnyɛ mo mo. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Egbo mi i yi sɛsɛsɛ, tetete, akwu ɛlɛ gba i shi mi ɔsɛkɛnɛ le mo. Ɔkwu nzu Okrasi gba e mondo ɛduma mi mo le. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, la lu zɔ onzu uwunawuna ombu mo. La lu rigbo kaa Ɔkwu nzu la gbama dɛ. Uwu gba a walaa apula iyi i nvyemo mbala egbo iyi onzonzu kwudu le. Mu kwuye kwɔngu gba onzonzu a na ipwɔma wu mbaa Ukpo kyakya la ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ e wo le.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, apula iyi mi so le akwu kwuwo yi kaka ka la lu vɔngɔ kiya munyi mi mbala Apɔlɔsi akwɛyi iso iyi bɔkɔ ɔ ka mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo tee, &lt;&lt;Lɔ pika kiya ingyi ɔ ka mo&gt;&gt; awu, lu zɔngɔma yi ma. Ɛlɛ i shi lu kwɛnwu mu onzu ukpɛnyi akwɛyi lu lafya la uwufo mo. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Ishi uwe bɔkɔ a za ŋa te ŋɔ ka onzu uwufo ma? Kimbe ba ŋɔ yi ngyi bɔkɔ akwu Ukpo gba e shi ŋɔ le mo? Akwiyi gba o shi ŋɔ ishimo, kimbe ki shi ŋɔ kwɛnwu kyamate o shi ŋɔ ishimo mo?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Ee, lu yi kiya ingyinangyina ingyi lu gyi-e e lo! Lunyi lu yi kwuwo o lo! Lunyi lu yi mu ɛsu irimo-o ba ikyo mbala nzu mo lo! Lɔ zɔ te lu kwu asu-o lala ba kinzu tete ki kwu asu mbala yi! <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Moo mi ma mate Ukpo e shi kinzu wa zɛ ilɔ te la ki kwu wambwambwa mu kiya ingyinangyina. Ki yi kyamate enzu umba o fu mbo mu ugu ugyi o rigbo te lo ngbɛ mba ma la eyi iyenzu gedegede tayi. Kinzu ki kwu kiya ingyi iyesemo la alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo mu oshi mbala enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ kaa lɔ ma kiya ingyi ki bi du nzu bi ŋa. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Kinzu ki kwu erendo kwuwongu Okrasi; lunyi ba lu kwu enzu umba amasa kwuwongu ilomesu yi mbala Okrasi! Kinzu ki yi ekpasu mo, lunyi ba lu yi ekpasu! Kinzu ɔ zhinzu ma, lunyi ba o lo yi mo! <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Iyɔkpɔɔ lonzu mbala ugbembyi u ngbɛ nzu ma; ki yi ekpayi iyi ilomo mo; kinzu ki kwu kiya ingyi ɛmu ikpama; kinzu ki yi kwuyinu ungwafyafyi nzu mo; <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />kinzu ki wo ɛduma mu ewo nzu dɛ gba ki ri kiya le. Gba enzu o kpa nzu ari, kinzu ba ki ta mba kenzu ungesheshi; gba o lonzu inyashi, kinzu ba ki yidu; <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />gba o so nzu iso iyira, kinzu ba ki gbamba opwu mu opwu uwoshi. Kekelele ki yi kyamate kwɔza ungwu kwudu kwɔlɛ tayi; ki kwu kiya ingyi kashi la kwudu kwɔlɛ nzhii ba ta ɔnɛ te!<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Akwu te mi ka yi apula ɛlɛ kaa la mi lo yi lovya le mo, Imi ka yi te kaa la mi yi yi mu alu le kwuwongu lunyi lu kwu ɛmɛ umba idɛnyi mi. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Ishi gba enzu umba o bɔ yi eyi mu Okrasi imbwaluma lo yi riba tetete lala, lu yi ada ukpɛnyi bi. Imi gba mi kwu ete yi le, moo Imi gba mi ka yi la iso iyi iyesheshi ɛlɛ keyi le. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, mi kpa yi ɛshɛku te la lu mondo mi mu luzɛ yi. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ mi lɔ Otimoti, umɛ mi uwu idɛnyi mi mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu Okrasi imbwaluma, uwu bɔkɔ Ɔkwu a nyama la wu munyi yi. Uwu e lolo yi iyi ewo iyi luzɛ mi izɛma mu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi imbwaluma, undu bɔkɔ lu zɛ kyaa mbala ɛzu iyi mi zɔ mu ɔshɔshi uwunawuna bɔkɔ mi fye.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Enzu umbafo meka yi o yi mu egunu ibɔma a, o to tee mi ŋi nyɔ munyi yi fo. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Gba Ɔkwu a nyama, mi nyɔ munyi yi afyi ɛlɛ kaa la mi ma mafyi mi ekpasu iyi enzu wa bɔ egunu mbɔlɛ o yi yi, moo akwu iso mbo isomo ɛnyi kɛɛkyi mo. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Moo Ɛsu irimo iyi Ukpo akwu iso iyi kenzu kɛɛkyi mo, ekpasu iyi kiya iwomo ingyi ki she la Ukpo gba ɔ gyi le. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Iyina bɔkɔ i she yi i ka? La mi bo munyi yi la kwuzele nana la mi zɔ yi idɛnyi mu opwu uwu oloto ŋa?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="ms">Onzu U To Kaya Lɔ Zɔ Wu Rɛnu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Enzu umbafo o ka mi la iso tee, kaya itomo ke kpo fyɛɛ mekeka yi, iyi bɔkɔ wa byi eshi lala o wo ɛlɛ mo. Mi pwa tee onzu a ŋɔ mbala oko uwu etewu kyamate oko wu tayi! <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Lunyi ba lu bɔma mu ɛlɛ? Ifate la lu wo ubwu ugyi akwɛyi onzu ele te lu wawuma mu igyirima yi mo? <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Imi mi yi mbala yi mɔmɔ mo, tetete mi yi mbala yi mu kwundu. Mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi, onzu uwu bɔkɔ e wo kiya ingyira ngyɛlɛ te awu, mi shi wu ombu uwoyi-e kyamate mi yi mɔmɔ mbala yi tayi. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ lu kpala ɛlu mu ekpasu iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi, Imi mi yi mɔmɔ mbala yi mu kwundu, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />lunyi la lu ra laa onzu ele te lu shi onzu uwoyi kaa la ngbɛ ɛnwu iyi ingbomo wu ma akwɛyi o sa kwunyɔ wu ma ɔnuwu Kwɔfyi ungwu Ɔkwu.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />I shoshi tee la lu kwɛnwu mu ɛlɛ mo! Lunyi lu yi kwoba ngwɔlɛ tee, &lt;&lt;Otutu owuna o kɛkyi e fye mu umbwu lɛɛbi akwɛyi u ye fuu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />La lu to otutu owuna uwekyi uwu ingbomo mo meka yi kaa la lu kwu enzu umbepo, kyamate bɔkɔ lu yi tayi-e awu. Kekelele kiya ingyinangyina ingyi Odumudumu uwu Ikalama nzu ki yi mɛzhi-e, moo o wo isabɔ mu Okrasi, umɛ uwu ilɔ uwu Odumudumu uwu Ikalama nzu-o. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ la ki wo Odumudumu uwu Ikalama nzu, mbala kwoburedi ungwu bɔkɔ kwu yi otutu owuna uwekyi uwu bɔkɔ akwu ingbomo mbala i ra laa onzu makɔ awu mo, la ki wo mu kwoburedi ungwu bɔkɔ kwu yi otutu owuna mo, kwoburedi ungwu egbo sɛsɛ mbala ongbulolo.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Imi mi kakwupu mi ka yi dɛ-ɛ te la lu kpa ɛnwu mbala enzu wa to kaya mo. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Mi so le akwu meka yi enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ wa to kaya, naa wa wo ekweyi, naa awɛlɔ, naa wa byeshi mo. Moo lakwu tayi de ba lu lafya la kwudu kwɔlɛ dɛ lo. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Iyi mi ye yi mu isomo gba i yi tee, la lu kpa ɛnwu mbala onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a ya ɛnwu wu te akwu u mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi ba a yama naa e wo ekweyi iyi apula iyira naa a byeshi naa e tutu enzu mo, naa akwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ e to ɛnwu e shi atɛ naa akwu uwɛlɔ. Enzu mbɔlɛ te la lu ri kiya mbala mba mo.<verse eid="1CO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Kimbe ki ta mi bɔkɔ mi zɔ ombu uwu enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu wa mbwalu mo. La lu zɔ ombu uwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu ɔshɔshi mbala yi awu. <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Ukpo gba aa zɔ ombu uwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu ɔshɔshi mo awu. Kyamate iso iyi Ukpo i so, &lt;&lt;La lu lu ra laa onzu uwura awu ma meka yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s1">Enzu Wa Mbwalu Lo Lo ewa Iyi esu Mbaa Enzu Umba Bɔkɔ Akwu Wambwalu Mo Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Akwiyi gba onzu ɛnyi meka yi e yi anu mbala u mbwalu uwufo, e wo la ba e lo ewa wu mbaa enzu umba Ukpo mo bɔkɔ e lo ewa mbaa enzu umba akwu wa mbwalu mo kaa lɔ zɔ wu ombu? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Lunyi lu yitu te enzu umba Ukpo gba o bo zɔ ombu uwu kwudu kwɔlɛ le mo re? Lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu bu zɔ ombu uwu kwudu kwɔlɛ le lu do embu iyɛriyɛri ɛlɛ izɔma moo? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Lunyi lu yitu te kinzu gba ki zɔ ombu uwu alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo le mo re? I bi gyi umba apula iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ! <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, gba lu yi anu mbala esu, la lu shi enzu umba bɔkɔ wa mbwalu o to mbo te akwu kiya kinyinyi mo awu, kaa lɔ zɔ yi ombu mo! <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Ɛlɛ akwu kiya ingyi lovya! Moo lu yi onzu ukpukpɛnyi te meka yi uwu bɔkɔ e yi amasa iyi bɔkɔ a zɔ anu iyi ɛmɛnɛ ma mo? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Ɔbulɛ ŋa umɛnɛ uwufo ba e yimo a ka e lo ewa iyi umanyi wu mu idu iyi umba bɔkɔ akwu wa mbwalu mo!<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Tabɔkɔ lu lo ewa iyi esu le, i zɔ te lu fɔma-a. I shoshi i ka kaa lɔ gyi yi anu byi mo? I shoshi i ka kaa lo wo yi iri byi mo? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Ɔbulɛ ŋa lunyi gba ba lu wo esu iri le, ba lu gyi anu iyi esu le, ɛlɛ ba lu wo yi laa ɛmanyi yi wa mbwalu tete! <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Lunyi lu yitu te enzu umba ira o fye mu Irɛsu iyi Ukpo mo mo? Onzu le kyoro yi mo mo; moo kala wa yama, laa wa byeshi, laa wa to kaya laa anzɔnu umba bɔkɔ ɔ nɔ mbala anzɔnu <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />laa awɛlɔ, laa wa wo ekweyi, laa umba bɔkɔ o ra lɛmba o shi atɛ, laa wa pe enzu ari laa wa wo iri, o fye mu Irɛsu iyi Ukpo mo. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Tayi gba lunyi umbafo ba lu yi le mekyi. Tetete lunyi ɔ gbɔ yi ingbomo yi ma-a, ba lu wulu ma-a, Ukpo e to ombu a sha yi kwuwongu Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi mbala Kwundu uwu Ukpo nzu.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">La lu Du Ukpo Ma Mu Ɛnwu Yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />&lt;&lt;Mi yi kapa unga kiya ingyinangyina iwomo,&gt;&gt; ɔbulɛ akwu kiya ingyinangyina gba mi ri ogbo ma ngyi le mo. &lt;&lt;Mi yi kapa unga kiya ingyinangyina iwomo,&gt;&gt; tetete mi ra laa ɛmi mi shi kiya ingyinangyina bi mo. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />&lt;&lt;Kiya ingyirimo o wongyi kwuwongu ubu, ubu tete o wo wu kwuwongu kiya ingyirimo.&gt;&gt; Ukpo ba a ŋa ngbɛ epepo yi ɛdɔma. Moo ɛnwu o wo yi kuwongwu iyama mo, o wo yi kaa lo wo ɛduma laa Ɔkwu; Ɔkwu ba e yese mbaa ɛnwu nzu. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Ukpo e yi Ɔkwu ma mu kwuvɔ, uwu ba ee yi nzu mo tete mu ekpasu wu.<verse eid="1CO 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Lunyi lu yitu tee ɛnwu yi akwu ɛnwu iyi Okrasi mo? Inyete mi ra la ɛnwu iyi Okrasi mi kpa mbala iyi okyirakyi ŋa le mo? Ayimo! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Lunyi lu yitu tee onzu uwu bɔkɔ a kpa ɛnwu wu mbala okyirakyi akwu ɛnwu ikpɛnyi mbala wu mo? Moo kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Enzu wepo mbamba oo kwu ɛnwu ikpɛnyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a kpa ɛnwu wu mbala Ɔkwu ba akwu ukpɛnyi mbala wu mu kwundu.<verse eid="1CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />La lu zɛ gboo lu shi iyama. Moo ingbomo lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ onzu e ngbo, akwu ɛnwu wu gba e ngbo mo le; onzu uwu bɔkɔ a yama ba ɛnwu wu gba e ngbo yi mo le. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Lunyi lu yitu tee ɛnwu yi akwu Ɔtɛpu uwu Kwundu uwu Ukpo, uwu bɔkɔ e yi mɛmi yi, uwu bɔkɔ lu na mbaa Ukpo awu mo? Ɛnwu yi ɛlɛ akwu iyayi fo, akwiyi Ukpo ŋa; <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />a ya yi la abwa gyɔɔ. Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ, la lu shi Ukpo inzumbɛku mu ɛnwu yi.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="ms1">Eyo Mɛka Iyi Oko Itomo Mbala Ɔnu Iyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Iso iyi bɔkɔ lu ka mi kwupu ma yi awu, i shoshi bi gba onzu e to oko mo. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Tetete, kwuwongu iyama i yi gyɔɔ ŋa awu, i shoshi tee uwewe le to oko uwawu, oko ba la ya ɔnu uwawu. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Ɔnu la nyi oko wu inɔma mo, oko ba la nyi ɔnu wu inɔma mo tete. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Moo akwu oko gba e yi ekpasu mu ɛnwu wu le fo, akwiyi ɔnu wu ŋa; tatayi akwu ɔnu gba e yi ekpasu mu ɛnwu wu le fo, akwiyi oko wu ŋa. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />La lu nyi esu inɔma ma mo, gba lu ŋu shi esu kwuye bwɛ kwuwongu lu ŋu shi ɛyi laa Ukpo ilɛma de ba la lu so kya dɛ; akwɛyi la lu gba lu kpa mbala esu kpɔ, kaa onzu uwoyi la ka yi laa ipwama iyi bɔkɔ lu fa la ɛnwu yi irima mo.<verse eid="1CO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Ɛlɛ mi so yi ele, mi tayi ɔkpa mo, amasa gba mi ta yi le byi. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Gba igyima la kwu ifyama ba mi gyi tee uwewe le yi kyamate Imi te; ɔbulɛ rɛshi ingyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi uwewe akwu ikikɔ ikikɔ, onzu ukpɛnyi e yi ngyɛlɛ, onzu uwufo ba e yi ngyewa.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Kekelele te mi so enzu umba bɔkɔ o do to eko mo mbala eko wa kpo anu ma tee, lo to eko mo ba lo ya anu mo kyamate Imi te. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Akwiyi gba umba o do ɛnwu mba iyimo mo, ba lo to eko, lo ya anu, i shoshi i ka ekweyi iyi bɔkɔ i ngbɛ mba ma.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o to eko-o naa o ya anu-o awu ba mi ta mba ɔkpa, uwu bɔkɔ e ngyi mbaa mi mo, e ngyi mbaa Ɔkwu tee: oko la lafya laa ɔnu wu mo; <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />akwiyi gba a fɔma mbaa ɔnu wu, ba la ŋa laa ɛwu, moo ba la gba le lomesu mbala ɔnu wu; ɔnu ba la lafya la oko wu mo.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />(Ɛlɛ akwu Imi, mafyi mi gba mi yi mu isomo le, moo akwu Ɔkwu mo) laa umba bɔkɔ o shimo tee: akwiyi gba umɛnɛ e yi oko uwu bɔkɔ akwu u mbwalu mo, oko awu ba a nyama te aa ŋɔ mbala wu, la ra wu ma mo. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Akwiyi gba oko u mbwalu e yi ɔnu uwu bɔkɔ akwu u mbwalu mo, ba a nyama te aa ŋɔ mbala wu, uwu la wɔma le shi ɔnu awu mo. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Moo ɔnu uwu bɔkɔ akwu u mbwalu mo awu, a wuluma sɛsɛ mbaa Ukpo kwuwongu ikyomesu mbala oko wu, tatayi oko uwu bɔkɔ akwu u mbwalu mo awu, a wuluma sɛsɛ mbaa Ukpo kwuwongu ikyomesu mbala ɔnu wu u mbwalu. Gba akwu tayi mo, ɛmɛ yi o yi kyamate ɛmɛ umba bɔkɔ o yi Ukpo mo tayi; tetete kwuwongu ukpɛnyi yi akwu u mbwalu Ukpo awu ɛmɛ yi tete akwu umba Ukpo. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Akwiyi gba onzu uwu bɔkɔ akwu u mbwalu mo awu a gyi tee le fulomo la lafya laa U mbwalu, le shiwobi le sheyimo iyawu. Umɛnɛ uwu bɔkɔ akwu u mbwalu akwu unye meka iyi ɛlɛ te mo. Ukpo a ya nzu ma kaa la ki ŋɔ moloto mbala umbafo. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Oko, ŋɔ yitu naa uŋɔ gba ŋɔ bi sa ɔnu ŋɔ ma lee? Na ɔnu, ŋɔ yitu naa uŋɔ gba ŋɔ bi sa oko ŋɔ ma lee?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Rima Mbaa Bɔkɔ Ukpo A Ya Ŋa Ma Awu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Uwewe la ri mu riyi ingyi Ɔkwu e shi wu mbala mu ingyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a ya wu ma. Ɛlɛ gba akwu kaza unga bɔkɔ mi ta laa ɛshɔshi lɛɛbi le. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a zɛ ɛsɔ ma dɛ gba Ukpo a ya wu ma le, la rayi tayi. Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a zɛ ɛsɔ ma dɛ gba Ukpo a ya wu ma le mo, la zɛ ɛsɔ ma shaa mo. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Laa ɛsɔ izɛma la kworiyo akwu kiya kinyinyi mo; eyi ibɔma mu ɔkpa uwu Ukpo gba ɔ gyi le. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Uwewe la ra la iyi bɔkɔ e yi ma yi dɛ ishi Ukpo a ya wu ma le awu. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Ŋɔ kwu unye kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Ukpo a ya ŋa ma awu re? Shi egbo ŋɔ mɛzhi ki taka mo; akwiyi gba ŋɔ yi ɔgwuzɛ uwu ŋɔ wɔma, ba wɔma. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Moo onzu uwu bɔkɔ akwu unye kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Ɔkwu a ya wu ma awu, akwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ Ɔkwu a wa wu ma a; tatayi onzu uwu bɔkɔ akwu unye mo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Okrasi a ya wu ma awu, akwu unye uwu Okrasi ŋa. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Ukpo a ya yi la abwa; la lu kwu enye umba enzu mo. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, uwewe la ri mu riyi ingyi bɔkɔ e yi dɛɛ ishi Ukpo a ya wu ma awu.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Eyo Mɛka Iyi Eko Umba O Do Ya Anu Mo Mbala Eko Wakpanuma Anu Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Iso iyi eko umba bɔkɔ o do ya anu mo awu: Ɔkwu e shi mi ɔkpa mo, Imi mii so yi iyi egbo mi mate onzu uwu bɔkɔ o nyama la wu kwuwongu eyembembyi iyi Ɔkwu. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Kwuwongwu inyashi iyi kwuye kwɔlɛ, mi ma tee i shoshi kaa uwewe la ŋɔ kyawu tayi. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Akwiyi gba ŋɔ to oko-o, de ba ki rawuma mo. Akwiyi gba ŋɔ di to oko mo, de ba ki gagyi oko shaa mo. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Akwiyi gba ŋɔ to oko, ŋɔ ngbomo mo; akwiyi gba umokokpayi a ya ɔnu, e ngbomo mo. Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e to oko naa a ya ɔnu, a ma inyashi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ a ka le, Imi ba mi gyi te la mi gyi yi ɔlu ma.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, iyi mi so yi ele gba akwu tee: kwuye kwu shi gyɔɔ fo, kwuwo kwɔlɛ enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi eko, lɔ ŋɔ kyamate o yi mbo mo tayi; <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />umba bɔkɔ o yi mu obobyi iwomo, lɔ ŋɔ kyamate o yi mu obobyi iwomo mo tayi; umba bɔkɔ o yi mwɔnyɛ imuma, lɔ ŋɔ kyamate umba bɔkɔ o yi mu ɔnyɛ imwuma mo tayi; umba bɔkɔ o ya kiya, lɔ ŋɔ kyamate kiya ngyɛngyi akwu ingyamba mo tayi; <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />umba bɔkɔ o yi apula iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ lo ra la ɛmba lo shi yi mo. Moo kwudu kwɔlɛ ta ki mangwu ole kwu nda laa ibomo fo.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Imi mi gyi tee la lu yi aka itama mo. Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi oko mo, a byi egbo iyi ɛduma iyi Ɔkwu, kaa le she laa Ɔkwu. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi oko ba e shi egbo wu mu apula iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ, kaa le she laa oko wu, <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />akwɛyi amasa wu i foyaa. Oko uwu bɔkɔ e yi ɔnu mo, e shi egbo wu mu ɛduma iyi Ɔkwu, iyi bɔkɔ uwu a gyi gba akwu tee a bɔ eyi mu ɛduma iyi Ɔkwu laa kwundu mbala egbo wu lɛɛbi; oko uwu bɔkɔ e yi ɔnu ba ee shi egbo wu mu apula iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ, kaa le she laa ɔnu wu.<verse eid="1CO 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Imi mi so yi ɛlɛ kaa la mi mbwa yi ma le bi moo akwu ɛga mo. Mi gyi tee la lu ŋɔ ɔnyɛ mu egbo ikpɛnyi kaa la lu wo ɛduma iyi Ɔkwu marimari.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Akwiyi gba onzu e yi mu anu ishimo iyi oko lɔri lɔri-e akwɛyi a ma tee ye wu mu kwuye ingbɛma, lɔri undu umoko awu ba lu yi gyɔɔ ɔ, de ba le towumo mate egbo wu i gyi tayi. Ɛlɛ akwu ingbomo mo, lo to esu byi. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Onzu uwu a ka mu egbo wu ba o kpa wu mu ega mo, ba e do ɛnwu wu irima, gba a zɔ te uwu a e to umoko awu mo, ishoshi. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ, onzu uwu bɔkɔ e to umoko awu, e wo ɔnyɛ, onzu uwu bɔkɔ e to wumo awu ba, e wo ɔnyɛ a ka le.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Oko la ŋɔma mbaa ɔnu wu mega nzhii ba lukwu; Akwiyi gba ɔnu wu e kpomo, ba la ya ɔnu awa uwu bɔkɔ egbo wu i gyi. Ɔnu awu ba lakwu u mbwalu Ɔkwu mega. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Mu imama mi, gba a ŋɔma kyawu tayi a mwɔnyɛ a ka le. Imi mi ma tee mi yi Kwundu uwu Ukpo tete.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Kwuyo Mɛka Iyi Abwa Iyi Eshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Mu kwupu ungwu lu ka meka iyi ivye iyi bɔkɔ o ngbɛ mu eshi, kinzu ki yitu tee, &lt;&lt;Ki yi iyitu kpɛkpɛnzu.&gt;&gt; Iyitu iyi kiya ba i bo la ibɔma; idɛnyi gba ba i mbo enzu ma le. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a mate uwu e yitu iyi kiya, e do yitu ngyi mo bɛnɛ. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a gyi Ukpo ba, Ukpo e yitu wu.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Iso iyi abwa iyi eshi irimo: Ki yitu tee eshi akwu kiya kinyinyi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ mo, Ukpo ba akwu ukpɛnyi moo uwufo e yimo. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Moo ananga iyi bɔkɔ enzu o ra yi o wo apula kyamate &lt;&lt;ukpo&gt;&gt; uwoshi mbala ɛzhi awu i yi mɔmɔ gyɔɔ. Ongbulolo gba e yi te, umba bɔkɔ o yi kyamate &lt;&lt;ukpo&gt;&gt; mbala &lt;&lt;akwu&gt;&gt; o yi riba, <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />tetete Ukpo akwu ukpɛnyi meka nzu, uwu gba akwu Ada uwu bɔkɔ kiya ingyinangyina ki wɔ munyi wu bɔkɔ kinzu ki ŋa wu le; Ɔkwu ba akwu ukpɛnyi, uwu gba akwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, uwu bɔkɔ e wo kiya ingyinangyina le bɔkɔ ki gba ki ŋɔ la wu le.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Akwu onzu uwunawuna gba ba e yi iyitu iyi ongbulolo ele mo. Enzu umbafo ba eshi i kyamba ɛnwu maa, akwɛyi gba o ri abwa ɛlɛ te, o ma kyamate umba o byi eshi tayi, kwuwongu bɔkɔ egbo mbo i di kɔma mo, akwɛyi o mate umba o ngbomo tayi. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Kiya ingyirimo ba ki re nzu kɛlɛ mbaa Ukpo mo; akwiyi gba ki ri, ki koshi mo, gba ki ri mo, ki koshi mo tete.<verse eid="1CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Lunyi ba la lu ngbɛndu, kaa lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu mate lu yi kapa unga kiya ingyinangyina iwomo awu lu shi umba bɔkɔ ikwu idu lu fulo mbo i kɔma mo lo ngbomo mo. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Moo akwiyi gba onzu uwu bɔkɔ ikwu idu lu fulo wu i kɔma mo a ma yi lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu yi &lt;&lt;iyitu&gt;&gt; tee lu yi mu kiya irimo mu kwunu ungweshi; ɛlɛ i kawu ɛnwu ma kaa le ri abwa iyi eshi mo? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Akwɛyi umɛnɛ uwu bɔkɔ Okrasi e kpomo kwuwo wu ele, e kpɛdɔma kwuwongu &lt;&lt;iyitu &gt;&gt; iyayi! <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Akwiyi gba lu ngbo la umanyi yi uwu bɔkɔ egbo wu i kɔma mo awu mu ɛlɛ te iwomo, de ba Okrasi gba lu ngbo wu mo le. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Kwuwongwu ngwɔlɛ, akwiyi gba kiya ingyi bɔkɔ mi ri ki shi umɛnɛ mi e ngbomo, de ba mi lafya la ivye ikumo, kaa la mi shi umɛnɛ mi u mbwalu la kpa mɛzhi mo.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ekpasu Mbala Ɛduma Iyi U zɛ ilɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Imi mi yi ekpasu iyi apula iyinayina iwomo mo re? Imi mi kwu uzilɔ mo re? Imi mi ma Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi mo re? Lunyi lu kwu rigbɛ mi ingyi ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ mi wo laa Ɔkwu mo re? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Akwiyi gba enzu umbafo o zɔ te Imi mi kwu u zɛ ilɔ mo lala, lunyi lu yitu tee Imi mi kwu u zɛ ilɔ, kwuwongu iyimo yi mu Ɔkwu i zɔ tee Imi mi kwu uzilɔ.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Ɔlɛ gba akwu opwu igbama mi le kwuyengwunanguna gba enzu o zɔ te Imi mi kwu u zɛ ilɔ mo: <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Kinzu ki yi ekpasu iyi kiya irimo mbala embyi iwomo kwuwongu ɛduma nzu mo re? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Wa zɛ ilɔ umbafo mbala ɛmanyi umba Ɔkwu nzu mbala Opita bɔkɔ o ka laa eko mbo wa mbwalu ma mu luzɛ le, kinzu ki yi ekpasu ɛnyi tete mo re? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Nana Imi mbala Obaraba kɛɛkyi gba i fate la ki fye enzu le ŋa?<verse eid="1CO 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Uwe bɔkɔ e wo ɛduma iyi asozha ba e fye ɛnwu? Uwe bɔkɔ e yi utu uwu eremi ba a nyama te e wo imuma yi mo? Uwe bɔkɔ e yi endo ba a nyama te e wo kwɔmɛ mba mo?<verse eid="1CO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Iso iyi mi so yi ele akwu mu imama iyi onzu mo, te gba Ɛrama iyi Omosisi i zɔ le. <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />O ka yi mu Ɛrama iyi Omosisi tee, &lt;&lt;Gba endo e yi mu ewiri ilɔma, lo ma wu kenzu ma mo.&gt;&gt; Mu imama yi akwu endo gba Ukpo e pwu idɛnyi wu le? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Akwu kwuwo nzu gba e siso ɛlɛ le mo? Ee mi so yi te mɛɛ, o ka iso ɛlɛ kwuwo nzu. I fa tee, onzu u gbama mbala onzu u lɔma lo fulo eyi te o fya ogbo mbo uwu apula iyi o lɔ. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Kinzu ki so eyi iyi Kwundu ma yi-e. Gba ki ri kule meka yi iyi apula iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ, ɛlɛ akwu kiya ingyɛkwu meka yi? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Gba enzu umbafo o yi ekpasu iyi kule irimo meka yi, ishoshi te kinzu la ki ri kule munyi yi ungwu ku ka ungwa mba ma mo?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Kinzu ba ki nyama tee la ki wo ɛlɛ mo. Kinzu ki bɔ enzu kepo mu idu kaa la ki se Ɛza Iyesheshi iyi Okrasi ɛlɛ ɔgwuzɛ ma mo. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Lunyi lu yitu tee enzu umba bɔkɔ o wo ɛduma mu Ɔtɛpu mɔmɔ gba o fya kiya ingyirimo mba le. Tatayi umba bɔkɔ o wo ɛduma mu ribɛ ingyi Ukpo, mɔmɔ gba o fya apula iyi bɔkɔ o bo yi te o wo isabo le.<verse eid="1CO 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Tatayi Ukpo a ta ɔkpa te enzu umba bɔkɔ o tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo, mɔmɔ gba lo fya kiya ingyirimo mbo le.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Imi ba mi nyama te la mi wo ɛduma mu ekpasu iyi mi yi yi ele mo. Imi ba mi ka yi kwupu kwɔlɛ le kaa la lu shi mi rigbɛ ingyi ɛduma mi mo. Imi mi kpomo kpeke ba i koshi la iyi bɔkɔ onzu uwufo a ba nyi mi ɛnwu ikwumo mu ɛlɛ! <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Kwuye ungwu mi yi mu anu itama iyi iso iyi Ukpo, mi kwu ɛnwu mo, moo akwu mɛga kaa la mi tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo. Gbetu mi, gba mi tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo mo! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Akwiyi gba mi wo ɛduma mi mu igyima mi, de ba mi fulo eyi iyi rigbɛ mi; Imi ba wo yi kwuwongu akwu ɛduma mi iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo gba e shi mi te la mi wo le. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Kimbe ba akwu rigbɛ mi? Rigbɛ mi gba akwu tee la mi tanu iyi Iso Iyesheshi ɛlɛ rɛshi, mi gyi te la mi zɔ te lo shi mi rigbɛ mega mo.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Imi mi yitu te mi kwu unye uwu onzu mo; Tetete mi wo ɛmi unye uwu uwewe kaa la mi bɔ laa enzu gyɔɔ mbaa Okrasi. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Kwuye ungwu mi yi mu ɛduma iwomo mbala Azhu, mi wo kyamate Ozhu tayi kaa la mi fya mba la mi bo mbo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi; mbaa enzu umba bɔkɔ Ɛrama iyi Omosisi i yi ekpasu meka mba, Imi uwu bɔkɔ Ɛrama iyi Omosisi i yi ekpasu mu reshi mi mo, mi wo ɛmi kyamate onzu uwu bɔkɔ Ɛrama iyi Omosisi i yi ekpasu mu reshi wu tayi kaa la mi fya mba la mi bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Tatayi mbaa enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo, mi wo kyamate mi kwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ akwu Ozhu mo tayi kaka kaa la mi fya mba la mi bo mbo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi. Ɛlɛ i zɔ tee mi mbwalu ɛrama iyi Ukpo mo mo; ɛrama iyi Okrasi i yi ekpasu mu reshi mi. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Mbaa enzu umba bɔkɔ o kɔma mu iso iyi Ukpo mo, mi wo kyamate umba tayi tete kaa la mi fya mba la mi bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi. Imi mi kwu apula iyinayina mbaa enzu lɛɛbi kaa mu ɔgwuzɛ uwunawuna enzu umbafo mba la mi sa mba ma. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Mi wo ɛlɛ lɛɛbi kwuwongu iso iyi Ukpo, kaa la mi fya esheshi yi ma. <verse eid="1CO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Lunyi lu yitu te gba enzu o yi mu ishi itomo iyi ɛnya irima mbala esu, onzu ukpɛnyi gba aa fya rigbɛ le. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, la lu ri ɛnya ɛnyi mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu lu fya rigbɛ ngyɛngyi ma. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e tishi iyi ɛninɛma mbala enzu umbafo, e lo ɛnwu wu inyashi iyɛkɔkɔ mu ivɔngɔma. Umba o wo ɛlɛ te kaa lo fya rigbɛ ingyi ki kpɛdɔma ɔnɔnuwa; kinzu ba ki wo ɛlɛ te kaa la ki fya rigbɛ ingyi bɔkɔ ri kpɛdɔma mo iyɔkpɔɔ. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Imi mi ri ɛnya iyi umbwa mo; ikpama mi tete mi kpa shaa mo. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Imi mi lo ɛnwu mi inyashi nzhii ba mi gwu yi mo. Imi mi wo ɛlɛ kaa kwuyengwu bɔkɔ mi mbwa enzu iso yi Ukpo isomo kaa Imi ba la mi fala rigbɛ ifyama mo.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="ms">La lu Rima Mbaa Eshi Ibyima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, mi gyi tee la lu lolo kiya ingyi ki du umba ete nzu umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu Omosisi awu. Umba kpɛkpɛ mba o fya igbomo iyi Ukpo mu kwɔmu, kpɛkpɛ mba o sa Risu Refyobyo ma moloto. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Umba kpɛkpɛ mba o wo mbo obatisima mu kwɔmu mbala risu tee umba o mbwalu Omosisi. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Umba kpɛkpɛ mba o ri kiya ingyirimo ingyi kwundu ngyɛlɛ, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />akwɛyi o wo embyi umba kwundu mbɔlɛ. Moo o wo embyi umba bɔkɔ ɔ wɔ mu ɔzɔ uwu kwundu uwu bɔkɔ a zɛ mbala mba awu; ɔzɔ ɔnwu gba akwu Okrasi mafyiwu le. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Tetete, Ukpo a mwɔnyɛ mbala umbafo mba umba o ka riba le mo, kwuwo ngwɔlɛ ɛkpɛzhi mba o fu ngbulo ngbulo mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara lɛɛbi.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i wo te kaa li zɔ nzu amasa, kaa la ki wo ekweyi iyi apula iyira mate bɔkɔ umba o wo awu mo, <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />nana la lu kwu wa byi eshi mate umbafo mbo o wo awu mo. Kyamate bɔkɔ o ka mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo awu tee, &lt;&lt;Enzu o ŋɔma te oo wo odumudumu akwɛyi o le mu eshi ibyima mbala iyama.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />La ki to kaya mo, kyamate bɔkɔ umbafo mba o wo - akwɛyi enzu edubu uwekpepo la edubu ɛla o kpomo ɔniyi. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />La ki pwa Ɔkwu ma mo kyamate bɔkɔ umbafo mba o wo - akwɛyi akwu i ngbɛ mba ma lɛɛbi. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />La ki zɔ anu mo, kyamate bɔkɔ umbafo mbo o wo - akwɛyi Ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwu lukwu a ngbɛ mba ma tayi.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi yi iyi i du mbo ele, i wo te kaa la ki vɔngɔ munyi mbo akwɛyi ba o ka yi ma te kaa la ki zɛ gboo mbaa ɛlɛ te iwomo. Moo kinzu ki yi mu kwuyengwu ibomo iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ-ɛ.<verse eid="1CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, gba ŋɔ ma tee ŋɔ rima gbagiri, ba ngbɛndu kaa ki tama mo. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Ipwama iyi bɔkɔ i du yi akwiyi bɔkɔ i koko i du enzu le. Ukpo akwu uwu o kwidu o fulo mawu, a nyama tee ipwama iyi i ka yi ekpasu ma li du yi mo. Kwuye ungwu o pwayima, ee shi yi ekpasu iyi idu iyimo, akwɛyi aa ka yi laa ɔgwuzɛ uwu iwɔma.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, ɛmɛza mi, la lu zɛ gboo mbaa eshi ibyima. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Mi so yi iso ɛlɛ kwuwongu bɔkɔ lu kwu enzu umba amasa le; lunyi la lu manda iso mi ɛlɛ ma mafyiyi. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Ago ungwu bɔkɔ ki gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi akwɛyi ki wo embyi ma ngu kwuyengwu kiya irimo ingyi onoyo ingyi Ɔkwu awu, i zɔ te ki kwu wakpɛnyi mbala Okrasi kwuwongu ɛnzhi wu wu. Kwoburedi ungwu bɔkɔ ki ka akwɛyi ki ri awu, i zɔ te ki kwu wakpɛnyi mbala Okrasi kwuwongu ɛnwu wu. <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Kwuwongwu kwoburedi akwu kwukpɛnyi byi, kinzu ba ki yi riba te le, kpɛkpɛ nzu ki kwu ɛnwu ikpɛnyi, moo kinzu kpɛkpɛ nzu ki ri kwoburedi kwɔlɛ kyaa.<verse eid="1CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />La lu yese enzu umba Izirɛ; enzu umba bɔkɔ o ri kiya ingyi bɔkɔ o wo isabɔ mangyi awu, akwu wakpɛnyi mu isabɔ iyi o wo laa Ukpo awu mo? <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Kiya ingyi mi yi mu isomo gba akwu tee, eshi nana kiya ingyirimo ingyi bɔkɔ o wo isabɔ la eshi mangyi akwu kiya kinyinyi le? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Ayimo! Iyi bɔkɔ mi yi mu isomo gba i yi tee, apula iyi bɔkɔ wabyeshi o wo isabɔ ma yi awu, o wo laa ɛndu iyira moo akwu Ukpo mo. Imi ba mi gyi tee la lu kyomesu mbala ɛndu iyira mo. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />I shoshi tee la lu wo embyi mu ago iyi Ɔkwu akwɛyi lu gba lu wo mu ago iyi ɛndu iyira mo; i shoshi tee la lu ri kiya ingyirimo mbala Ɔkwu akwɛyi lu gba ri mbala ɛndu iyira mo. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Nana ki gyi tee la ki shi Ɔkwu le wo rise ŋa? Kinzu ki kawu ekpasu ma re?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />O zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;O nya nzu ma te la ki wo kiya ingyinangyina byi.&gt;&gt; Tegba i yi le, tetete akwu kiya ingyinangyina gba ki shoshi le mo. &lt;&lt;O nya nzu ma te la ki wo kiya ingyinangyina byi,&gt;&gt; tetete akwu kiya ingyinangyina gba kii mbwama laa onzu le mo. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />La lu gagyi iyeshi lɛyi kɛɛkyi mo, lunyi ba la lu gagyi iyeshi laa enzu umbafo tete.<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />La lu ya ivye iyi kwoya mu rishi kaa la lu kwu byi, la lu yo eyo mbaa bɔkɔ i ngyi mo, kwuwongu egbo yi i bi tutumo kwuwongu mbaa bɔkɔ ki ngyi mo. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Moo, mate bɔkɔ kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ, &lt;&lt;Ɛzhi mbala kiya ingyinangyina bɔkɔ ki yi ma yi lɛɛbi akwu ingyi Ɔkwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Gba onzu uwu akwu u mbwalu mo a lɔ la yi mbaa kiya ingyirimo akwɛyi lu ka, la lu ri kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ o ka yi byi, la lu yo eyo mo kwuwongu egbo i bi tutumo kwuwongu mbaa bɔkɔ ki ngyi mo. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Akwiyi gba onzu uwufo a za yi te, &lt;&lt;Kiya ingyirimo ngyɛlɛ o wo ngyi isabɔ laa eshi,&gt;&gt; de ba la lu ri ngyi mo, kwuwongu onzu uwu bɔkɔ e so yi iso awu, i kyo kaa egbo yi li yi ingbomo mo, <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />iyi bɔkɔ mi yi mu isomo gba i yi tee, akwu kwuwongu egbo iyi onzu awu, moo akwu iyayi mo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 10:29">Moo onzu uwufo e yo kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;I wo te ba kapa unga mi yi nga unga kiya iwomo le ba onzu uwufo e se mi ngo mo kwuwongu egbo wu? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Akwiyi gba mi gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi kwuwongu kiya ingyi mi ri, i wo te ba onzu uwufo e gwu mi anu kwuwongu kiya ingyirimo ingyi bɔkɔ mi gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi kwuwo ngyi?<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ ŋɔɔ wo, shi akwu kiya irimo naa embyi iwomo, wo yi lɛɛbi kaa Ukpo la fya iduma ma. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />La lu shi enzu lo ngbomo mo, laa Azhu loo laa enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo loo laa wa mbwalu Ukpo. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />La lu wo mate bɔkɔ wo tayi; Imi mi gyakpɔɔ te kaa la mi wo iyi bɔkɔ uwewe a gyi, mi byegbo iyeshi lɛmi kɛɛkyi mo, Imi ba mi gyi iyeshi la enzu lɛɛbi, kaa lo fya isama ma.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />La lu mondo mi, kyamate bɔkɔ Imi mi mondo Okrasi tayi.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Kiya Ikpomo Mu Reshi kwuyengwu Ukpo Ilɛma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Mi pwɔ yi ma kwuwongu lu koko lu lolo mbaa mi akwɛyi lu gba lu ra la ɛzu ɔnyɛnyɛ kyamate bɔkɔ mi zɔ yi awu. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Imi ba mi gyi tee la lu yitu tee, u to keyi uwu ɔnzɔnu uwunawuna akwu Okrasi, u to keyi uwu okokpayi akwu ɔzɔnu akwɛyi u to keyi uwu Okrasi ba akwu Ukpo. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Ɔnzɔnu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a lɛ Ukpo naa a tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo kwuyengwu igyirima iyi odudu ba e koko reshi wu mo, onzu awu tayi e lo Okrasi lovya. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Tatayi okokpayi uwunawuna uwu uwu bɔkɔ a lɛ Ukpo naa a tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo kwuyengwu igyirima iyi odudu ba reshi wu ri yɛwu, okokpayi awu e lo ɔnu wu lovya; e yi kyamate oko uwu bɔkɔ a gbɛ inyi iyi reshi wu ma tayi. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Akwiyi gba okokpayi e kpo kiya mu reshi mo, ba la gbɛ inyi wu ma. Akwiyi gba inyi igbɛma naa inyi ikpolomo akwu kiya ingyi lovya meka iyi eko, de ba i shoshi tee le kpo kiya mu reshi.<verse eid="1CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />I shoshi tee ɔnzɔnu le kpo kiya mu reshi mo, kwuwongu ɔnzɔnu akwu u wɔ mbala igba iyi Ukpo. Oko ba akwu igba iyi ɔnzɔnu; <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />moo ɔnzɔnu a wɔ mu okokpayi mo, okokpayi gba a wɔ mu ɔnzɔnu le. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />O wo ɔnzɔnu kwuwongu okokpayi mo, okokpayi gba o wo wu kwuwongu ɔnzɔnu le. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ i shoshi tee okokpayi le kpo kiya mu reshi kwuwongu alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo o yi mu imama, ɛlɛ i zɔ tee e loshi laa anu wu.<verse eid="1CO 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Mu Ɔkwu imbwaluma, okokpayi e yi ikikɔ mbala ɔnzɔnu mo, naa ɔnzɔnu e yi ikikɔ mbala okokpayi mo. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Moo kyamate bɔkɔ okokpayi a wɔ mu ɔnzɔnu awu, tatayi gba okokpayi ba a mba ɔnzɔnu le; tetete kiya ingyinangyina ki ngyi mbaa Ukpo.<verse eid="1CO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Lunyi la lu zɔ ombu lɛyi; i shoshi tee okokpayi la lɛ Ukpo kwuyengwu igyirima iyi odudu ba e kpo kiya mu reshi wu mo? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Ewo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e wo apula mu kwudu kwɔlɛ le i zɔ tee, gba ɔnzɔnu a lafya laa inyi wɔzhi ba e kpolo yi mo mo, akwu kiya ingyi lovya, <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />akwiyi gba okokpayi ba a lafya laa inyi wɔzhi, akwu kiya ingyi ɛnwu ikwumo meka wu. O shi wu inyi iyi wɔzhi kaa la kwa wu kyamate okpayi uwu e kpo mu reshi wu tayi. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Akwiyi gba onzu uwufo a gyi te le ri kaambu mu ɛlɛ, mi gyi te la mi za wu te, kinzu mbala ɛshɔshi iyi Ukpo ki yi uukwu owa mo kwuyengwu igyirima iyi Ukpo ilɛma nzu.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiya Ingyirimo Ingyi Onoyo Ingyi Ɔkwu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Omatiyu 26.26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Omaki 14.22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Oluku 22.14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Mu ɔkpa uwu mi shi yi ele, mi pwɔ yi ma mo, moo igyirima yi iyi Ukpo ilɛma i bo laa iyira i ka iyeshi ma. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Iyi kwonze, mi pwa tee, mu igyirima yi, enzu o kama uzhi uzhi; Imi mi nyama laa iso iyi mi pwa le. (<verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Ee akwu ɛga tee ikama ikikɔ ikikɔ li yi meka yi kaa la ki yitu enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu umba Ukpo.) <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />kwuyengwu lu gyirima mu ɔshɔshi, akwu kiya ingyirimo ingyi Ɔkwu gba lu ri le mo. <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />moo kwuyengwu lu ka mbaa kiya irimo, lu rigbo la esu mo akwɛyi onzu uwufo e yi mo la lonzu, uwufo ba e wo embyi nzhii ba o yi wu mo. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Lunyi lu yi agba yi iyi bɔkɔ lu ri lu wo mo re? Naa lu gyi te la lu zhi ɔshɔshi uwu Ukpo ma akwɛyi ba lu wo umba bɔkɔ o yi ngyi mo ɛnɛ ŋa? Lunyi lu gyi tee la mi za yi te? Lu gyi tee la mi pwɔ yi ma mu ɛlɛ? Imi mi pwɔ yi ma mo! <verse eid="1CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Moo ɛzɔ iyi mi shi yi ele, mi na mbaa Ɔkwu nzu tee: mutu uwu bɔkɔ o ya kwoya wu awu, Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi e to kwoburedi, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />mizhikembo iyi a gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi, a mu ngu ma akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Kwoburedi kwɔlɛ akwu ɛnwu mi, iyi bɔkɔ o shi kwuwo yi. La lu koko lu wo ɛlɛ kaa la lu lolo mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Tatayi, mizhikembo iyi o ri kiya ma akwɛyi e to embyi umba ago akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Embyi umba ago mbɔlɛ akwu iso iyi bɔkɔ o so o shi mɛzhi iyepo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e wo mu ɛnzhi mi. La lu koko lu wo ɛlɛ, kwuyengwunguna ungwu lo wo ago ɛlɛ, la lu koko la lu lolo mbaa mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Moo kwuyengwunanguna ungwu bɔkɔ lu ri kwoburedi kwɔlɛ lu gba lu wo embyi umba ago mbɔlɛ, i zɔ tee lu yi mu anu itama iyi lukwu undu Ɔkwu nzhii ba a gbama. <verse eid="1CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, gba onzu e ri kwoburedi ungwu Ɔkwu kwɔlɛ naa e wo embyi umba ago umba Ukpo mbɔlɛ ba e yese ɛnwu ma dɛ mo, onzu awu tayi e ngbomo kwuwongu a nzhii ɛnwu iyi Ɔkwu mbala ɛnzhi wu ma. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, i shoshi tee onzu le yese ɛnwu ma dɛ gba le ri kwoburedi kwɔlɛ, le wo embyi umba ago mbɔlɛ le. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Gba onzu e ri kwoburedi kwɔlɛ naa e wo embyi mbɔlɛ umba ago umba Ukpo ba a zɔngɔma ma te akwu ɛnwu iyi Ɔkwu mo, onzu awu tayi a ka laa ɛnwu wu laa ombu uwoyi uwu Ukpo. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Akwu kwuwo kwɔlɛ gba ɛnwu iyi umbafo yi ikɔma mo ba i yi gɛlɛ mo le, umbafo gyɔɔ ba o kpomo-o. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Akwiyi gba ki yese enzu ma ɔnyɛnyɛ dɛ, Ukpo a ngbɛ nzu ombu uwoyi mo. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Akwiyi gba Ɔkwu a ngbɛ nzu ombu uwoyi, uwu e ye nzu mu izɔma kaa la ki kyo mbala enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ kaa la ki kpɛdɔma mo.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, ɛmɛnɛ mi, gba lu gyirima te lu ri kiya, ingyi onoyo ingyi Ɔkwu, la lu rigbo esu. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Gba onzu e yi lonzu, le ri kiya mogba wu dɛ, kaa Ukpo le yi yi ombu mo kwuyengwu lu gyirima.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 11:34">Kwuye ungwu mi bo mbaa yi, mi so yi iso iyi i shimo.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Rɛshi Ingyi Bɔkɔ Kwundu Uwu Ukpo E Shi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Mɛka iyi iso iyi rɛshi ingyi bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Ukpo e shi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:1">ɛmɛnɛ mi, mi gyi tee la lu yitu iyi ongbulolo meka yi. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Lunyi lu yitu tee, kwuyengwu bɔkɔ lu du yitu iyi Ukpo mo awu, o kyoro yi mo mu ɛgwuzɛ ikikɔ ikikɔ akwɛyi lu byi eshi iyi bɔkɔ i yi kwunyɔ mo. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ mi gyi tee la lu yitu tee, onzu uwu bɔkɔ Kwundu uwu Ukpo e yi mbala wu, e do tee &lt;&lt;Ira li mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi!&gt;&gt; gbee mo, tatayi onzu e do tee a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔzhizɔsi akwu Ɔkwu&gt;&gt; mo gba Kwundu uwu Ukpo e yi mbala wu mo.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Rɛshi ingyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo ri yi ikikɔ, ikikɔ, Kwundu awawu gba ba ee shi le. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Ɛgwuzɛ iyi bɔkɔ ki wo ɛduma laa Ukpo i yi ikikɔ, ikikɔ, tetete akwu Ɔkwu ukpɛnyi gba o ye mu ɛduma iwomo le. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Ɛduma iyi iwomo i yi ikikɔ, ikikɔ byi, kpɛkpɛyi ba akwu Ukpo ukpɛnyi gba e shi uwewe ekpasu iyi iwomo le.<verse eid="1CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Ukpo e shi uwewe rɛshi kaa li zɔ tee Kwundu uwu Ukpo e yi ma nzu kaa enzu lɛɛbi lo fya esheshi. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Onzu uwufo, Kwundu e shi wu ilukwu iyi iso isomo, onzu uwufo ba Kwundu ele tete gba e shi wu amasa iyi iso isomo le. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Onzu uwufo Kwundu e shi wu rɛshi ingyi ikwu idu lu fulo iyɛku, uwufo ba o shi wu rɛshi ingyi ɛkpasu iyi enzu efya ibomo, kpɛkpɛyi ba akwu Kwundu ele tete gba e shi le. <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Kwundu e shi onzu uwufo ɛkpasu iyi apula iyi amɛ iwomo; uwufo ba o shi wu rɛshi ingyi anu itama iyi iso iyi Ukpo; uwufo tete o shi wu rɛshi ingyi bɔkɔ a zɔngɔma rɛshi ingyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo ma mbala reshi ingyi bɔkɔ akwu ingyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo mo. Onzu uwufo o shi wu rɛshi ingyi iso isomo mu lunzu undepo, uwufo ba o shi wu rɛshi ingyi iluma iyi iso isomo mu lunzu undepo ndɔndu. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Ekpasu iyi iwomo ɛlɛ kpɛkpɛyi akwu Kwundu ukpɛnyi ele gba e shi le; uwu ba e shi uwewe kyamate bɔkɔ egbo wu i gyi.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kpɛkpɛnzu Ki Kwu Ɛnwu Ikpɛnyi Laa Asanga Riba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Ɛnwu i yi asanga riba; tetete akwu ɛnwu ikpɛnyi. Tegba Okrasi e yi le.yi. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Moo Kwundu uwu Ukpo ukpɛnyi gba e wo nzu obatisima le kaa la ki kwu ɛnwu ikpɛnyi, laa Azhu laa enzu umba akwu Azhu mo, laa enye laa enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu enye mo, Kwundu ukpɛnyi ele e yi kyamate embyi umba bɔkɔ kpɛkpɛnzu ki wo tayi.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Moo ɛnwu i yi asanga riba, moo akwu asanga ikpɛnyi mo. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Akwiyi gba kwɔlɛ kwu zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Kwuwongwu Imi mi kwu kwuwo mo awu ba mi kyo mbala ɛnwu ɛlɛ mo,&gt;&gt; akwu kwuwongu isomo ngwu ɛlɛ gba i shi kwu kyo mbala ɛnwu ɛlɛ fo le mo. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Tatayi, akwiyi gba kwɔlu kwu zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Kwuwongwu Imi mi kwu kwuyi mo awu ba, mi kyo mbala ɛnwu ɛlɛ mo,&gt;&gt; akwu kwuwongu isomo ngwu ɛlɛ gba i shi kwu kyo mbala ɛnwu ɛlɛ fo le mo. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Gba ɛnwu kpɛkpɛyi lakwu kwuyi, ba ipwama o pwa mungye? Gba ɛnwu kpɛkpɛyi lakwu kwɔlu, ba umbwɔ o se mungye? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Iso iyi ongbulolo gba i yi te, Ukpo a nɔngɔ asanga iyi ɛnwu ikikɔ ikikɔ kyamate bɔkɔ a ka yi mu egbo wu le. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Gba asanga iyi ɛnwu kpɛkpɛyi lakwu kwɔsanga kwukpɛnyi, ɛnwu i yi mo! <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Ongbulolo e yi tee, ɛnwu i yi asanga riba, tetete akwu ɛnwu ikpɛnyi.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, kwuyi kwu do tee kwu za la kwuwo tee, &lt;&lt;Imi mi yi ugɔ ŋɔ mo!&gt;&gt; mo. Reshi tete ri do tee ri za laa alɛ tee, &lt;&lt;Imi mi yi ugɔ ŋɔ mo!&gt;&gt; mo. <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Ongbulolo gba e yi te, asanga iyi bɔkɔ ki ma yi tee i do ugɔ ukpukpɛnyi isama mo awu gba ba ki yi ugɔ yi i ka le, <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />asanga iyi bɔkɔ ki ma yi tee i yi umwɔ mo awu gba ba ki shi yi umwɔ i ka le; akwɛyi asanga iyi bɔkɔ i shoshi tee enzu lo ma yi mo awu gba ba ki bɔ eyi ma yi ɔnyɛnyɛ le, <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />munɛ ba asanga iyi bɔkɔ enzu o ma yi ba ki kpo yi ekpayi mo. Ukpo a nɔngɔ asanga lɛɛbi e lomesu kaa asanga iyi bɔkɔ kinzu ki ma tee i yi umwɔ mo awu gba ba ki shi yi umwɔ ikiika le. <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />Ikama iyi ɛnwu li yi mo, kaa asanga ɛlɛ ii mbwama lesu kyakya. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Akwiyi gba kwosanga ungwu ɛnwu kukpɛnyi kwu pwa ofya, akwu ɛnwu kpɛkpɛyi gba i pwa ofya mbala ngwu le; akwiyi gba kwosanga kukpɛnyi kwu fya ipwɔma, ɛnwu kpɛkpɛyi i mu ɔnyɛ mbala ngwu tete.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Lunyi kpɛkpɛyi lu yi kyamate ɛnwu iyi Okrasi tayi, uwewe yi ba e yi kyamate kwosanga ungwu ɛnwu iyi Okrasi tayi. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Mekeka iyi enzu wa mbwalu, Ukpo a ŋa wa zɛ ilɔ keyi, akwɛyi anukenzu o mbwalu, akwɛyi uzhi uwɔla akwu wa zɔ ɛzu; akwɛyi umba bɔkɔ o wo apula iyi amɛ, akwɛyi umba bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi mbo ekpasu iyi enzu ofya ibomo, akwɛyi umba bɔkɔ o mbwama laa enzu, akwɛyi umba bɔkɔ o ra laa enzu ɔnyɛnyɛ, akwɛyi umba bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi mbo rɛshi ingyi iso isomo mu lunzu undepo o mbwalu. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Akwu lɛɛbi mba gba akwu wa zɛ ilɔ le? Lɛɛbi gba akwu anukenzu le? Lɛɛbi gba akwu wa zɔ ɛzu le? Akwu lɛɛbi gba o yi ɛkpasu iyi apula iyi amɛ iwomo le <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />naa iyi enzu ofya ibomo le Naa iyi iso isomo mu lunzu undepo le Naa ɛkpasu iyi lunzu undepo ndɔndu iluma le. <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, lunyi la lu shi egbo yi mu rɛshi ingyi ri ka le.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Imi ba mi zɔ yi ɔgwuzɛ uwu bɔkɔ u sheshi u ka le lɛɛbi.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Idɛnyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Akwiyi gba mi so lunzu undu enzu mbala lunzu undu alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo kego, ba mi yi idɛnyi mo, mi yi kyamate kwoso ungwu kwu wanu ngɔngɔngɔ naa kalɔ unga ka wanu ngingingi tayi. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Akwiyi gba mi yi rɛshi ingyi anu itama iyi iso iyi Ukpo; mi yi iyitu lɛɛbi akwɛyi mi zɔngɔma kiya ingyi invyemo mo, gba mi yi ikwu idu lu fulo iyi bɔkɔ i turu lɔwa ma, ba mi yi idɛnyi mo, mi kwu kiya kinyinyi te mo. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Akwiyi gba mi kwu apula iyi bɔkɔ mi yi lɛɛbi mi wo yi rɛshi, i kyo ɛnwu mi kaa lo pwu yi mo mɔyi, ba mi yi idɛnyi mo, mi fya kiya kinyinyi te mo.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Idɛnyi i yidu, i yi kyoo; i wo anya iyi onzu mo, i kwɛnwu mo, i fulo ɛyi mu kadu mo; <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />idɛnyi i shi reshiyama mo, i gyi ɛyi kɛɛkyi mo, ba i wo amba efyefya mo; idɛnyi i ra laa amba mu egbo mo; <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />Idɛnyi i mwɔnyɛ mu ira iwomo mo, inyi ba i mwɔnyɛ mu ongbulolo iwomo. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Idɛnyi i fu ewo mo; ikwidu fulo yi, mbala eyifulomo yi, mbala idu iyimo yi ba ii fɔma mo. <verse eid="1CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Idɛnyi i yi iyɔkpɔɔ. Anu itama iyi iso iyi Ukpo ii bomo, iso isomo mu lunzu undepo i bomo; iyitu tete i bomo. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Moo rɛshi ingyi iyitu nzu mbala anu itama iyi iso iyi Ukpo nzu akwu kwurizhi bɛnɛ; <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />kwuyengwu bɔkɔ kiya ingyi ki nyɔlɔma ki bo, ingyi bɔkɔ ki nyɔlɔma mo ba ki tomo.<verse eid="1CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />kwuyengwu bɔkɔ mi kwu umɛshɛri awu mi siso kyamate umɛshɛri te, mi bi egbo kyamate umɛshɛri te, mi ka amasa kyamate umɛshɛri te; kekelele bɔkɔ mi kwu onzu uwakɔ ŋa le, mi shi iwomo iyi imɛshɛri mɛzhi-e . <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Kiya ingyi ki ye ngye mu imama kekelele le ki yi kyamate kwundu mu umɛbɛ te; mu kwɔfyi kwɔngu ki ma eyi mbala eyi gedegede. Kiya ingyi mi yitu ngyi kekelele le akwu kwurizhi bi; mu kwɔfyi kwɔngu gba ki yitu ngyi mamari le kyamate bɔkɔ Ukpo e yitu mi tayi awu.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Apula ekpela iyi bɔkɔ i shoshi tee la ki yi yi akwu: ikwu idu fulo mbala eyi ifulomo mbala idɛnyi; iyi bɔkɔ i ka mekeka iyi apula ekpela ɛlɛ lɛɛbi gba akwu idɛnyi le.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s1">Rɛshi Ingyi Anu Itama Iyi Iso Iyi Ukpo Mbala Lunzu Ikikɔ Ikikɔ Isomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />La lu gyakpɔɔ la lu gagyi idɛnyi. La lu shi egbo yi mbaa rɛshi ingyi kwundu igagyima, ingyi anu itama iyi iso iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o so lunzu undepo awu, o so laa enzu mo, o so laa Ukpo, moo onzu uwu a zɔngɔma iyi o yi mu isomo ma e yi mo. O yi mu iso iyi kwunvyeru isomo mu ɛkpasu iyi Kwundu. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo ba o so laa enzu kaa li mbwa mba ma, li ka mba ɛnwu ma kaa li gbo mbo idu mo. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o so lunzu undepo, o mbwama laa ɛmba ma kɛɛkyi, enzu umba bɔkɔ o tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo ba o mbwama laa ɔshɔshi lɛɛbi. <verse eid="1CO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Imi mi gyi tee lɛɛbi yi la lu siso mu lunzu undepo; tetete iyi bɔkɔ i shemi i ka akwu reshi ingyi anu itama iyi iso iyi Ukpo. Moo onzu uwu bɔkɔ a tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo a ka onzu uwu bɔkɔ e so lunzu undepo awu ma, ba akwu te onzu uwu a luma e yi mɔmɔ loo kaa ɔshɔshi lɛɛbi la fyaa imbwama ma. <verse eid="1CO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, imbwama iyina ba lu fya munyi mi gba mi bo mbaa yi akwɛyi mi le mu lunzu undepo isomo ba akwu tee, mi ka yi laa iso iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a wu a ta mi ya nduu kwudu, naa iyitu, naa iso iyi kwundu, naa ɛzɔ iyi Ukpo mo? <verse eid="1CO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />I yi kyamate apula iyi bɔkɔ o so amu ma yi bɔkɔ i yi kwunyɔ mo, kyamate ombula naa kumburu, i zɛ tee bɔkɔ onzu e yitu iyi anu ngwu, akwiyi gba o kpa ngwu kaa enzu lo pwa mo? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Akwiyi gba o kpa kwulɔ ungwu ewa kaa la kwu wanu mamari mo, uwe bɔkɔ e yi ɛnwu ma iyi ewa? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Tayi gba i yi le, i zɛ te bɔkɔ onzu a zɔngɔma iso iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ yi mu isomo mu lunzu undu epo undu bɔkɔ o yi ndu mo? Iso ɛnyi tayi akwu iyi umbwa! <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Lunzu lu yi ikikɔ ikikɔ mu kwudu kwɔlɛ, nganangana ba ke yi iluma nga. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Akwiyi gba mi pwa kenzu unga bɔkɔ enzu o yi mu isomo le ma mo, enzu mbamba akwu ugboga munyi mi, Imi ba mi kwu ugboga munyi mbo tete. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Tegba lunyi lu yi le tete.Tabɔkɔ lunyi lu bɔkpɔɔ te la lu yi rɛshi ingyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo awu, la lu gyakpɔɔ kaa la lu fya rɛshi ingyi Kwundu ingyi bɔkɔ ri mbwama mu ɔshɔshi imbomo awu.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e so lunzu undepo, akwu mega kaa la nda Ukpo le shi wu rɛshi ingyi iluma tete. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Moo gba mi lɛ Ukpo mu kenzu ungepo, kwundu mi gba kwu yi mu Ukpo ilɛma le, egbo mi ba i fya kiya kinyinyi te mo. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ, inyete mi wo te? Mi lɛ Ukpo mu kwundu mi, ba mi gba mi lɛ Ukpo mu egbo mi tete; Mi so amu mu kwundu mi, ba mi gba mi so amu mu egbo mi tete. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />kwuyengwu ŋɔ gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi mu kwundu kɛɛkyi, i zɛ te bɔkɔ enzu umba bɔkɔ o ye ŋɔ mu ipwama ba o yi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ so mo akwɛyi ɔ zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Li yi tayi&gt;&gt; laa Ukpo ilɛma uwu ɛnyi igbɛlɛma ŋa? O so mo kwuwongu o yitu iyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ yi mu isomo mo. <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Igbomo ŋɔ yi mu Ukpo ilɛma marimari bi, ɔbulɛ ŋa onzu uwufo ba i mbwa wu ma mo ndii.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Imi mi ngbede laa Ukpo te, mi so lunzu undepo mi ka yi ma lɛɛbi. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />kwuyengwu ɛlu ikpalama mu ɔshɔshi ba, i she mi kaa la mi so iso ɛkpɛlɔ bi iyi bɔkɔ enzu o zɔngɔma yi ma, kaa la mi zɔ umbafo, i ka iso edubu guruguru mu lunzu undepo ma.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, la lu yi kyamate ɛmɛshɛri te mu egbo ibyima yi mo, lunyi ba la lu byi egbo kyamate enzumbakɔ tayi. La lu yi kyamate ɛmɛshɛri tayi mbaa ira iwomo. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Mu kwokpo ungwu iso iyi Ukpo o ka yi ma tee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">&lt;&lt;Ɔkwu a zɔ tee, i zɛ mu enzu umba bɔkɔ o so lunzu undepo gba mi siso mbala enzu mi le.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">I zɛ mu lunzu undu agboga gba mi siso le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">tetete enzu mi o pwa iso mi mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ, rɛshi ingyi isisomo mu lunzu undepo akwu kɛzɔ laa enzu umba bɔkɔ o towo Ɔzhizɔsi imbwaluma, moo akwu laa wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi mo. Tatayi rɛshi ingyi anu itama iyi iso iyi Ukpo akwu kɛzɔ laa wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi, moo akwu laa umba bɔkɔ o towo Ɔzhizɔsi imbwaluma mo. <verse eid="1CO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, gba enzu lɛɛbi umba ɔshɔshi, o kpalɛlu akwɛyi onzonzu e le mu iso isomo mu lunzu undepo akwɛyi enzu umbafo naa enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi mo o fyemo o du yi, o zɔ tee lɛɛbi yi lu kporishi moo? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Akwiyi gba onzonzu e le mu anu itama iyi iso iyi Ukpo akwɛyi enzu umbafo naa enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi mo o fyemo o du yi mu iso isomo, iso ɛnyi i fye mbo mo akwɛyi o kwu ira mba ɔsu kwuwongu iso iyi bɔkɔ o pwa awu. O zɔ mba ombwu mu iso iyi bɔkɔ o pwa le, <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />egbo mbo iyi bɔkɔ i nvyemo awu o ta yi kwudu nduu, akwɛyi o kwumo mu Ukpo ɔya igbomo, o ta mɛzhi akwɛyi o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ukpo e yi munɛ mbala yi kego!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukpo Ilɛma Gbgbɔ Mu Ɔshɔshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, kiya ingyi mi so le gba i ŋɔ le tee, kwuyengwu lu kpala ɛlu te kaa la lu lɛ Ukpo, onzu uwufo e yi kwɔmu, onzu uwufo e yi ɛzu iyi a gyi tee la zɔ, onzu uwufo e yi ɛbɛ iyi bɔkɔ a ma mbaa Ukpo, onzu uwufo ba e yi isisomo mu lunzu undepo akwɛyi onzu uwufo e yi iluma iyi iso iyi bɔkɔ o so awu. Iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ o wo, lakwu iyi bɔkɔ i mbwama laa ɔshɔshi. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Akwiyi gba enzu umbafo ɔ gyi tee le siso mu lunzu undepo, lo pika enzu wepo naa wala ma mo, lo so lo shelesu akwɛyi li yi onzu uwu bɔkɔ a lu iso iyi bɔkɔ o so awu ma mɔmɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Akwiyi gba onzu uwu bɔkɔ a luma e yi mo, de akwu mega kaa onzu uwu bɔkɔ e so lunzu undepo awu, la lafya laa isomo kaa le so laa ɛnwu wu mbala Ukpo. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Enzu wepo naa wala umba bɔkɔ o shi mbo iso iyi Ukpo awu gba lo so le, enzu umba bɔkɔ o shi mo awu ba lo manda iso ɛnyi ma kaa lo ma. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Akwiyi gba onzu uwufo mu ɛlu ikpalama ɛnyi a ma ɛbɛ mbaa Ukpo, onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu iso iyi Ukpo isomo awu la lafya la isomo dɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Lɛɛbi yi lu do tee lu tanu iyi iso Ukpo kɛnyikɛnyi, kaa onzonzu la vɔngɔ akwɛyi a fya ɛnwu ɛkɔ ma. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o zɛ ilɔ iyi Ukpo lo yi ɛnwu mba ma kaa lo wo gbgbɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Moo Ukpo nzu akwu Ukpo kakara mo, kinzu ba la ki yi kyoo mbala idigbomo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Mu ɛshɔshi iyi enzu umba Ukpo lɛɛbi, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />eko lo kpala kenzu mbo mo kwuyengwu ɛlu ikpalama. O shi mbo kapa kaa lo siso mo; kyamate bɔkɔ Ɛrama iyi Azhu i zɔ, umba akwu watekeyi mo. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Akwiyi gba o gyi tee lo vu undu uwu kiya ba, lo yo anu mba eyo mogba. Akwu kiya ingyi lovya kaa okokpayi le siso mu ɛlu ikpalama iyi ɔshɔshi.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Iso iyi Ukpo i ngyi mba yi re? Naa lunyi kɛɛkyi gba i bo mbaa yi le ŋa? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Akwiyi gba onzu uwufo yi a ma te akwu ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo naa e yi rɛshi ingyi kwundu, de le yitu tee kwupwu ungwu mi ka yi ele akwu okpa uwu Ɔkwu. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Akwiyi gba e towo iso ɛlɛ ma, lunyi ba la lu pwawu ɛkwu mo. <verse eid="1CO 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ, ɛmɛnɛ mi, la lu to egbo yi la lu ta mu anu itama iyi iso iyi Ukpo, tetete la lu se onzu ukpukpɛnyi ɔgwuzɛ uwu lunzu undepo i so mo mo. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Kiya ingyinangyina ba akwu mega kaa lo wo ngyi ɔnyɛnyɛ mbala gbgbɔ.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s1">Iyimo Iyi Okrasi Mu Kwuvɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Mi gyi te kaa la mi lolo yi ɛmɛnɛ mi, iyi ilɔ iyesheshi iyi bɔkɔ mi zɛ yi awu, iyi bɔkɔ lu na yi ma akwɛyi ikwu idu lu fulo yi i rima ngiri ma yi awu. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Akwiyi gba lu nyama laa anu itama iyi rɛnu ingyi Ukpo ingyi bɔkɔ mi ta yi awu mu egbo yi ngiri, lu fya isama ma. Moo de ba ikwu idu lu fulo yi akwu shaa.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Moo mi shi yi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ mi na, ingyi bɔkɔ ri yi ogbo gyɔɔ: te Okrasi e kpomo kwuwongu ingbomo nzu, kyamate bɔkɔ o ka o fu mu kwokpo ungwu iso iyi Ukpo awu; <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />tee o pwuwumo akwɛyi ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwola o yi wu mo mu kwuvɔ, kyamate bɔkɔ o ka mu kwokpo ungwu iso iyi Ukpo awu; <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />tee a zɔ ɛnwu ma laa Opita akwɛyi laa wa zɛ ilɔ wewo la wepo mbamba. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Mizhikembo iyɛnyi, a zɔ ɛnwu ma laa wa mbwalu umba o pika ederi ɛlɔ ma kwuye kwukpɛnyi kya, umbafo mba gyɔɔ o degbo lakwunyɔ, umbafo ba o kpomo-o. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Akwɛyi a gba a zɔ ɛnwu ma laa Ozhemisi, akwɛyi mizhikembo iyɛnyi, a zɔ ɛnwu ma laa wa zɛ ilɔ lɛɛbi.<verse eid="1CO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Mu imbwama yi, a zɔ ɛnwu ma laa Imi tete, Imi uwu bɔkɔ mi yi kyamate onzu uwu evya i gyirima dɛ mo gba o mbawu le. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Moo Imi gba mi kwu umbwambwa uwu wa zɛ ilɔ le lɛɛbi, Imi lala mi domo te kaa lo ya mi te u zɛ ilɔ mo, kwuwongu mi lo enzu umba ɔshɔshi uwu Ukpo inyashi gyɔɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Akwu kwuwongu esheshi iyi Ukpo gba ba mi kwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ mi kwu ɔnɛnɛ le, esheshi iyi bɔkɔ e shi mi ele akwu shaa mo. Imi ba mi wo ɛduma mi ka wa zɛ ilɔ umba bɔkɔ o shimo le mo, ba akwu iwomo mi mo, esheshi iyi Ukpo gba i wo ɛduma ma mi le. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ, gba i ngyi munyi mi naa munyi mbo, ɛlɛ gba akwu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki tanu ngyi le, ɛlɛ gba ba akwu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ lu nyama la ngyi le.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyimo Nzu Mu Kwuvɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Akwiyi gba o tanu tee Okrasi e yimo mu kwuvɔ-ɔ, i zɛ te ba umbafo yi o zɔ te igba la iyimo mu kwuvɔ iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo-o awu i yi mo? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Akwiyi gba i yi kyamate bɔkɔ lu so awu kego, de ba Okrasi e yimo mu kwuvɔ mo; <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />akwiyi gba Okrasi e yimo mu kwuvɔ mo, de ba ki yi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki tanu ngyi mo, lunyi ba lu yi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ lu nyama la ngyi mo. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Akwiyi gba akwu ongbulolo tee enzu o yimo mu kwuvɔ mo, de ba o yi nzu ombu kwuwongu imulo iyi ki mulo Ukpo, kwuwongu ki so yi tee Ukpo e yi Okrasi ma mu kwuvɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Moo akwiyi gba enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo o gbala iyimo mu kwuvɔ mo de ba Okrasi e yimo mu kwuvɔ mo. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Akwiyi gba akwu ongbulolo te o yi Okrasi mo mu kwuvɔ mo, de ba ikwu idu lu fulo yi akwiyi umbwa, lunyi ba lu degbo lu tomo mu ingbomo yi bɛnɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />I kyo i zɔ tee enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o kpomo-o bɔkɔ o fulo egbo mu Okrasi awu o to mo. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Akwiyi gba eyi ifulomo nzu mu Okrasi akwu kwuwongu kiya ingyi kwudu kwɔlɛ kɛɛkyi, de ba ki kwu enzu umba inyashi ki kaa uwewe ma mu kwudu kwɔlɛ.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Ongbulolo gba e yi tee o yi Okrasi mo mu kwuvɔ, ɛlɛ gba akwu kɛzɔ le tee enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpondo mu Okrasi, o gba mba la iyimo mu kwuvɔ tete. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Moo kyamate bɔkɔ lukwu lu zɛ mu onzu ukpɛnyi gba lu bo le awu, tatayi gba iyimo mu kwuvɔ i zɛ mu onzu ukpɛnyi gba i nyɔ le tete. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Moo kyamate bɔkɔ enzu lɛɛbi o kpomo i zɛ mu Adɛmu awu, tayi gba enzu lɛɛbi o yi mbo mo mu kwuvɔ i zɛ mu Okrasi le tete. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Uwewe ba e yimo mu kwuye wu: Okrasi e yi keyi; akwɛyi kwuyengwu a ba gbama awu, enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu umba wu, o yi mbo mo mu kwuvɔ tete. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Akwɛyi, kwudu kwɔlɛ ku bomo; Okrasi a na ekpasu iyi enzu umbeyi ma, mbala umba idomo, mbala asu akwɛyi a ra laa Ɛsu e shi Ukpo Ada. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Moo Okrasi e ri ɛsu mega nzhii ba kwuyengwu Ukpo e ri enzu umbeyi wu mo lɛɛbi mu ewa akwɛyi e fu mbo mu alɛwu. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Onzu uwoyi u mbwambwa uwu bɔkɔ o ngbɛwu ɛdɔma akwu lukwu. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Moo kwokpo ungwu iso iyi Ukpo kwu zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ukpo akwu apula lɛɛbi e lo yi mu ɔnwu uwu Okrasi.&gt;&gt; I ta ndu tee, &lt;&lt;apula lɛɛbi&gt;&gt; iyi bɔkɔ o so awu i kyo Ukpo mafyiwu mɛmi mo, kwuwongu uwu gba e lo apula lɛɛbi mu ɔnwu uwu Okrasi le. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e lo apula lɛɛbi mu ɔnwu uwu Okrasi, akwɛyi Okrasi mafyiwu, uwu bɔkɔ akwu umɛ uwu Ukpo awu, e to ɛnwu e lo mu ɔnwu uwu Ukpo, uwu bɔkɔ akwu apula lɛɛbi e lo mu ɔnwu wu awu; akwɛyi Ukpo ee ri ɛsu iyi apula lɛɛbi.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Akwiyi gba iyimo mu kwuvɔ i yi mo, kimbe ba akwu esheshi iyi obatisima uwu bɔkɔ enzu mbɔlɛ o wo laa enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo-o? Umba ɔ gyi tee lo fya mbɛ ma yi? Akwiyi gba umba bɔkɔ o kpomo-o o yimo mo, kyamate bɔkɔ umbafo o so, kwuwongu mbɛ bɔkɔ enzu mbɔlɛ o wo mbo obatisima kwuwongu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo-o? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Kinzu ba kwuwongu mbɛ bɔkɔ ki lo ɛnwu nzu mu kumbɛ kwuyengwunaguna? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, Imi mi ma lukwu kwɔfyi kwɔfyi! Imi so tayi kwuwongu mi kwu ɛnwu ma yi kwuwongu ikyomesu nzu mbala Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi Ɔkwu nzu. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Akwiyi gba la kwu iyi onzu bi, Imi mi kiri ewa mbala &lt;&lt;izɔfyi umba akata&gt;&gt; munɛ mu Ɛfɛsɔ. Ogbo uwu mbɛ bɔkɔ mi fya? Gba lɔ zɔ tee umba bɔkɔ o kpomo o gbala iyimo mu kwuvɔ mo de ba kyamate kwoba kwu zɔ, &lt;&lt;La ki ri la ki wo, moo kwɔnyi kwɔlɛ ki ŋi kpomo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Enzu lo kyoro yi mo mo. &lt;&lt;Imɛza irimo mbala enzu umbira i tutu onzu uweshi mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />La lu gba la lu bo mbaa egbo yi iyeshi ɛnyi kaa la lu lafya la ingbomo. Umbafo yi o yitu iyi Ukpo mo. Mi so ɛlɛ kaa lovya la lu wo yi mo le.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛnwu Iyi Bɔkɔ O Yimo Mu Kwuvɔ La Yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Onzu uwufo ba o yo kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Ii wo te ba onzu uwu bɔkɔ e kpomo-o oo gba wu la iyimo mu kwuvɔ? Ɛnwu iyina bɔkɔ e yi yi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Orondo ele! Kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ so ngyi mo awu ki kpomo dɛ gba ki bi bi iyi le. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ so ngyi mo awu akwu kwuyi kwukpɛnyi bi, igboshimo akwu kwuyi ungwu owiti naa kwuyi ungwu ewiri iyifo bi, moo akwu uwɛyi ngyɔɔ mafyi wu mo akwɛyi mizhikembo kwu bulɔma. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Ukpo ba ee shi kwuyi kwɔngu ɛnwu kyamate bɔkɔ a gyi; ee shi kwuyi ungwunanguna ɛnwu iyi bɔkɔ i fa ma ngwu.<verse eid="1CO 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Akwu ɛnwu lɛɛbi gba akwu ikpɛnyi le mo; enzu o yi ɛnwu iyamba ikikɔ, izɔfyi o yi iyamba, afyi o yi iyamba, emu tete o yi iyamba. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Ɛnwu iyoshi i yi, ɛnwu iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ i yi tete; woshi umbwu ɛnwu iyoshi u yimo mbala umbwu ɛnwu iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Ɔnu u yi woshi bwu ikikɔ, ɔvya u yi woshi mbu ikikɔ, elovyo i yi woshi yi; elovyo lala iyi woshi ikikɔ ikikɔ.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Iyimo mu kwuvɔ tegba i ŋi yi le. kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ɛnwu o pwuyimo, i vama; kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o yi yi mo mu kwuvɔ ba, i vama mo. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Ɛnwu i ma inyashi kwuyengwu o pwuyimo mɛzhi, kwuyengwu o yi yimo mu kwuvɔ ba i yi inzumbɛku. kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o pwuyimo mɛzhi i kɔma mo, kwuyengwu o yi yi mo ba i kɔma. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ o pwuyimo, akwu ɛnwu iyi onzu; kwuyengwu o bo yi yi mo awu akwu ɛnwu iyi kwundu. Tabɔkɔ ɛnwu iyi onzu i yi awu, ɛnwu iyi kwundu i yi tete.<verse eid="1CO 15:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Moo kwokpo ungwu iso iyi Ukpo kwu zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu kwonze, Adɛmu, o ndo kwondo wu e yi kwunyɔ&gt;&gt;; Adɛmu umbwambwa ba akwu Kwundu u shi kwunyɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Akwu ɛnwu iyi kwundu ba i bo keyi le mo, ɛnwu iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ gba i bo keyi le, akwɛyi iyi kwundu i mbwalu. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Onzu uwu kwonze, o wo wu mu umbwuru, a wɔ mɛzhi; Onzu uwopo ba a wɔ moshi. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ, o yi kyamate onzu uwu bɔkɔ o wo wu mu umbwuru umbwɛzhi awu; enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu umba oshi ba o yi kyamate onzu uwu bɔkɔ a wɔ moshi awu wɔ moshi awu. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Tabɔkɔ ki yi kyamate onzu uwu bɔkɔ o wo wu mu umbwuru umbwɛzhi awu, tatayi gba ki bi yi kyamate Onzu uwu a wɔ moshi awu le tete.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Iyi bɔkɔ mi ye yi mu isomo, ɛmɛnɛ mi, gba i yi tee, ɛnwu nzu iyi ɛnzhi i ri ogu mu ɛsu irimo iyi Ukpo mo, tatayi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki vama ki ri ogu uwu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki vama mo mo. <verse eid="1CO 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />La lu ngbalu, mi so yi kiya ingyi invyemo: Akwu kinzu lɛɛbi gba ki kpomo le mo, kinzu lɛɛbi ba gba ɔ vindɔ nzu ma le, <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />mu i wo pere iyi eyi akwɛyi kɛlɛlɛ, o kpa kwongangaraki kwu mbwambwa. Moo o kpa kwongangaraki akwɛyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo-o awu o gbamba laa iyimo mu kwuvɔ, akwɛyi o kpomo gbee fo, akwɛyi kinzu ba o vindɔ nzu ma. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Moo ɛnwu nzu i yi bɔkɔ i vama le, mega o vindɔ yi ma kaa lakwiyi bɔkɔ i vama mo; ɛnwu nzu iyi bɔkɔ i kpomo le, mega o vindɔ yi ma kaa lakwiyi bɔkɔ i kpomo mo. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ingyi ri vama ba ri vama fo, ingyi bɔkɔ ri kpomo bɔkɔ ri kpomo fo, akwɛyi iso iyi bɔkɔ o ka mu kwokpo ungwu iso iyi Ukpo i nyɔlɔma te: &lt;&lt;Lukwu ɔ ngbɛnduma-a; ibyima iyi lukwu ɔ mbwayima-a!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />&lt;&lt; Lukwu, muna bɔkɔ ibyima ŋa i yi fo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:55">Lukwu, muna bɔkɔ kɛtu ŋɔ ke yi fo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Ingbomo gba akwu kɛtu unga lukwu le, ingbomo ba i fya ekpasu yi mbaa Ɛrama. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Ɛnyi ba lakwu iyi Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e shi nzu ki byi lukwu ma i zɛ mu Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi!<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, ɛmɛnɛ mi umba idɛnyi mi, la lu rima ngiri kaa kiya kinyinyi la ki wo yi akpa mo. La lu to ɛnwu yi la lu ta laa ɛduma iwomo iyi Ɔkwu, kwuwongu lunyi lu yitu tee ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ lu yi mu iwomo laa Ɔkwu le akwu shaa mo.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s">Imbwama Laa Enzu Umba Ukpo Umba Bɔkɔ O Yi Igɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Mɛka iyi iso iyi i mbwama laa enzu umba Ukpo mu Ozhudiya: Lunyi tete la lu wo kyamate bɔkɔ mi so ɛshɔshi iyi Ogalatiya tayi. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Kwɔfyi ungwu aladi umbanambana, onzonzu le to meka iyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ e yi ngyi kaa le shi mɛzhi kaa le be shi, kaakwuyengwu mi bo kaa lo na eduwo ikpikpɛnyi te fo. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Mizhikembo iyi mi bo, mi kwupwu ungwu i zɔ ɛmi ma laa enzu umba bɔkɔ lu nyama la mba akwɛyi mi lɔ mba kaa lo to rɛshi yi lo so ngye mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Gba akwu mega tee la mi so tete, ba o fye mi mo.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu E Yi Ɛnwu Ma Iyi Luzɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Mizhikembo iyi mi fula ɛzhi iyi Omasedoniya ma, mi nyɔ munyi yi, moo mega mi mi zɛ mu Omasedoniya. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Igboshimo mi wo afyi epo mo mbala yi, nzhii ba ɔnɛka u wɔ ma dɛ kaa lu mbwami ma kaa mi shekeyi la luzɛ mi munamuna bɔkɔ mi sheyimo. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Mi gyi tee la mi ma yi kwuye bwɛɛ bi akwɛyi mi pika yi ma mo; moo i yi egbo mi tee mi gyi mi wo afyi gyɔɔ mbala yi, gba Ɔkwu a nyama.<verse eid="1CO 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Imi ba mi ŋɔ mu Ɛfɛsɔ nzhii ba ɔnu uwu odumudumu uwu Ɔpɛtakɔ. <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />Moo ɔgwuzɛ uwu ɛduma iyeshi u wuma munɛ, enzu umbeyi ba o yi riba.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Gba Otimoti e bo munyi yi, la lu na wu mu egbo ikpɛnyi, moo e yi mu ɛduma iwomo laa Ɔkwu kyamate Imi bɔkɔ mi yi mu iwomo tayi. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Onzu ukpukpɛnyi te la zhi wu ma mo, lunyi ba la lu mbwa wu ma kaa la zɛ luzɛ wu moloto, kaa la gbama le be du mi; moo mi yi mu eyi wu ishimo te a gbama mbala ɛmɛnɛ.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Meka iyi umanyinzu Apɔlɔsi, mi kpawu ɛshɛku iyinayina tee la zɛ mbala ɛmɛnɛ umbafo kaa le so munyi yi, uwu ba a gyi tee le so kekelele mo. Gba a fya kwuye mo, e ri.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Iso Imbwambwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />La lu rima mu igbomo, la lu rima ngiri mu ikwu idu fulo yi, la lu wiyi mo, la lu rima laa ɛkpasu. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ luu wo la lu wo yi mu idɛnyi.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, lunyi lu yitu iyi Ositifana mbala agba wu; umba gba akwu wa mbwalu umba kwonze le mu Akaya, akwɛyi umba o to ɛnwu mba o shi te o wo ɛduma laa enzu umba Ukpo. Mi kpayi ɛshɛku, ɛmɛnɛ mi, <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />tee la lu lomo laa enzu mbɔlɛ te, mbala onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e wo ɛduma mbala mba.<verse eid="1CO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Mi mwɔnyɛ iyi ibomo iyi Ositifana, mbala Ofotunatu mbala Akayikusu; kwuwongu ibomo mbo i yi kyamate akwu lunyi gba lu bo le tayi <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />i shi egbo mi i wuluma puratata, kyamate bɔkɔ umba ɔ wuluyi egbo mo puratata tete awu. Enzu mbɔlɛ te ishoshi tee lo yitu mbo.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Ɛshɔshi iyi i yi mu ɛzhi iyi Eshiya o lɔma tee, lɔ gbɛlɛ yi ɛnyi mamari; Akwila mbala Opirisila mbala ɔshɔshi uwu bɔkɔ a kpala ɛlu mogba mba awu, o lɔma tee lɔ gbɛlɛ yi ɛnyi marimari mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu nzu. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Ɛmɛnɛ lɛɛbi munɛ o lɔma tee, lɔ gbɛlɛ yi ɛnyi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:20">La lu gbɛlɛ esu ɛnyi, la lu kpaa esu idu iyi oloto.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Imi, Ɔpɔlu, gba mi ka ɛlɛ le mafyi mi: Ɛnyi igbɛlɛma mbaa Ɔpɔlu.<verse eid="1CO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e pwu idɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu mo, e kpɛdɔma sa wu. Omarana ta, Bo ŋa loo Ɔkwu!<verse eid="1CO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Esheshi iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi li yi mbala yi.<verse eid="1CO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Idɛnyi mi li yi mbala lɛɛbi mu ɛnyi iyi Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi. Li yi tayi.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>